ck if PT101 exists by listing the points. Then I'll need to switch to a different stage that has alarm configuration capabilities.\n\nAccording to the workflow, the next stages available include CONFIG_ALARM, which would be appropriate for configuring alarms. But first, let me verify the point exists."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2139, "output_tokens": 203, "latency_ms": 7439.6481000003405, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户确认PT101存在，现在处于CONFIG_ALARM阶段，可以使用manage_alarms工具。用户要求为PT101配置高限报警，阈值2.0，中等优先级。根据工具列表，应该使用create_analog_alarm动作。需要提供id、tag、high_limit和priority参数。id需要唯一命名，可以命名为\"alarm_PT101_high\"。tag是\"PT101\"。high_limit是2.0。priority是\"medium\"。low_limit和deadband可选，保持默认null和0.0。现在调用工具。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3106, "output_tokens": 449, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 16881.720200000927}, "judge": null}
