tency_ms": 6499.257499999658, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先查看项目中的点位，确认 TI-201 是否存在及其当前配置。让我查询一下点位列表。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure alarms for a point called \"TI-201\":\n- HH (High-High) alarm at value 100\n- LL (Low-Low) alarm at value 10\n- Both with priority set to \"high\"\n\nLet me first check if the point \"TI-201\" exists by listing the points. I'm in the ANALYZE_INTENT phase, and the available tools are manage_pages (list_pages) and manage_points (list_points).\n\nLet me query the points to find TI-201 and understand its current configuration."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2076, "output_tokens": 448, "latency_ms": 11568.33639999968, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "确认了 **TI-201** 是一个模拟量点位（analog）。现在我来为它创建两个报警：\n\n1. **HH（高高限）报警**：阈值 100，优先级 high\n2. **LL（低低限）报警**：阈值 10，优先级 high", "reasoning": "The user wants to set up HH (High-High) and LL (Low-Low) alarms for the point TI-201, with:\n- HH alarm at 100\n- LL alarm at 10\n- Both with priority \"high\"\n\nThe point TI-201 exists and is an analog type. Now I need to create two analog alarms for this point. I can use the `create_analog_alarm` action twice - one for the high-high limit and one for the low-low limit.\n\nLet me create both alarms:\n\n1. HH alarm: \n   - id: something like \"alarm_TI-201_HH\"\n   - tag: \"TI-201\"\n   - high_limit: 100\n   - priority: \"high\"\n\n2. LL alarm:\n   - id: something like \"alarm_TI-201_LL\"\n   - tag: \"TI-201\"\n   - low_limit: 10\n   - priority: \"high\"\n\nI can make both calls at the same time since they're independent."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4186, "output_tokens": 348, "latency_ms": 18567.293000000063, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "两个报警已成功创建！以下是配置汇总：\n\n| 报警 ID | 监测点位 | 类型 | 阈值 | 优先级 | 状态 |\n|---------|---------|------|------|--------|------|\n| alarm_TI-201_HH | TI-201 | 高高限 (HH) | 100 | high | ✅ 已创建 |\n| alarm_TI-201_LL | TI-201 | 低低限 (LL) | 10 | high | ✅ 已创建 |\n\n**配置逻辑：**\n- 当 TI-201 的值 **≥ 100** 时，触发 HH 报警\n- 当 TI-201 的值 **≤ 10** 时，触发 LL 报警\n- 两个报警均为 **高优先级**，确保及时响应\n\n如果还需要为 TI-201 添加 HI（高限）或 LO（低限）报警，或者需要为其他点位配置报警，请告诉我。否则，任务已完成。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user seems to be repeating the stage prompt. The alarms have already been successfully created in the previous step. Let me summarize what was done and confirm completion to the user.\n\nBoth alarms were created successfully:\n1. alarm_TI-201_HH - High-High alarm at 100, priority high\n2. alarm_TI-201_LL - Low-Low alarm at 10, priority high\n\nThe task is complete, so I should inform the user and suggest moving to the next state (DONE or another relevant stage)."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7236, "output_tokens": 971, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 36652.15790000002}, "judge": null}
