"result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7299999997485429, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:621a63847510f896127d367c0ca566b2205f7109b72d13e1d89c0b32df465bc4", "final_hash": "sha256:621a63847510f896127d367c0ca566b2205f7109b72d13e1d89c0b32df465bc4", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 126, "latency_ms": 6160.834899999827, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我先帮你查一下当前工厂中所有的点位和历史归档配置情况，然后再帮你处理。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Add history configuration to all points in the factory\n2. Export the history configuration\n\nLet me first check what points are currently configured and what history configuration already exists. I'll call both list_points and list_history to get the current state."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1201, "output_tokens": 633, "latency_ms": 18815.488100000948, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据查询结果，当前情况如下：\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **点位总数** | 2 个（P1 模拟量、P2 数字量） |\n| **已配置历史归档** | 0 个 |\n| **待配置** | P1、P2 都需要添加 |\n\n---\n\n**⚠️ 很抱歉，我目前无法完成您的需求。**\n\n原因如下：\n\n1. **添加历史归档**：当前 `manage_history` 工具仅支持 **查看** 已配置的历史归档（`list_history`）和 **查询** 历史数据（`query_history`），**不支持新增、修改或删除历史归档配置**。\n\n2. **导出配置**：当前阶段没有提供导出工具。\n\n---\n\n### 🔧 您可以尝试以下方式：\n\n- **手动配置**：在 SCADA 工程软件中为 P1、P2 逐个添加历史归档策略（采样周期、存储时长等）。\n- **切换到其他阶段**：如果您需要继续其他配置任务，我可以帮您切换到下一阶段（如报警配置、脚本配置、部署等）。\n\n请问您希望我帮您切换到哪个阶段继续操作？或者您有其他需求吗？", "reasoning": "Looking at the current situation:\n\n1. There are 2 points configured: P1 (analog) and P2 (digital)\n2. There are no history configurations yet\n\nThe user wants to:\n1. Add history to all points\n2. Export the configuration\n\nHowever, I'm in the CONFIG_HISTORY stage and my available tools are:\n- list_history: List configured historian tags\n- query_history: Read a synthetic historical window for a tag\n\nI don't have a tool to ADD history configurations (like an \"add_history\" or \"configure_history\" action). I also don't have an export tool.\n\nThe manage_history tool only supports:\n- list_history: List configured historian tags and parameters\n- query_history: Read a synthetic historical window for a tag\n\nI cannot add history configurations with the current tools available to me. I should let the user know that the current available tools don't support adding history configurations or exporting. \n\nSince the current stage's available tools don't satisfy the user's need (adding history and exporting), I should suggest switching to another stage or inform the user about the limitation.\n\nLooking at the next states available: CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE\n\nNone of these seem to be for adding history configuration either. Let me be honest with the user about what I can and cannot do with the current tools.\n\nI should inform the user that:\n1. I found 2 points (P1 and P2) with no history configured\n2. The current available tools only allow me to LIST history configurations and QUERY historical data, but NOT to ADD/MODIFY history configurations\n3. I also don't have an export tool available\n\nI should be transparent about the limitations."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2173, "output_tokens": 759, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 24982.000799998787}, "judge": null}
