s": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 292, "latency_ms": 10748.94729999869, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想给\"全厂所有的点\"添加历史记录配置，然后导出。根据当前阶段（ANALYZE_INTENT），我需要理解用户的意图。用户想要给所有点添加历史配置，这涉及到历史配置管理（manage_history），但当前阶段只允许list_history操作，无法添加或修改历史配置。同样，manage_points当前也只允许list_points操作。\n\n用户的需求需要两个操作：1) 获取所有点列表；2) 为所有点添加历史配置。但当前可用的工具只有查询功能，没有添加历史配置的功能。根据行为准则第5条，若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。下一个阶段应该是CONFIG_HISTORY，因为那里应该有添加历史配置的工具。\n\n首先，我应该查询当前所有点和历史配置，了解现状。调用manage_points列出所有点，同时调用manage_history列出当前历史配置。这样我才能评估需要添加多少点。\n\n让我同时调用这两个工具。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1715, "output_tokens": 433, "latency_ms": 15953.363000000536, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户希望给所有点添加历史记录，然后导出。我现在处于 CONFIG_HISTORY 阶段，可用的工具有 manage_history（支持 list_history、enable_history、set_retention）和 manage_points（仅支持 list_points）。首先，我需要列出所有点，了解有哪些点需要配置历史记录。之前调用 list_points 时出错，因为 type_filter 参数要求是字符串，而不是 null。我应该重新调用，这次不指定 type_filter 或者指定为某个值。但问题是，用户想给所有点添加历史记录，我需要知道有哪些点。让我先正确调用 list_points。然后，我需要为每个点启用历史记录。但这里有个问题：enable_history 操作一次只能处理一个标签。如果点很多，手动操作会很繁琐。不过，我可以先列出所有点，然后为每个点调用 enable_history。但考虑到效率，也许我可以先让用户确认是否真的要为所有点添加历史记录，或者询问是否有特定类型的点需要配置。不过，用户明确说了\"全厂所有的点\"，所以我应该执行。但根据行为准则，我需要谨慎处理高危操作。批量添加历史记录可能涉及大量配置变更，但我不确定这是否属于高危操作。高危操作准则主要提到的是强制下装、批量删除/禁用等。批量添加历史记录可能不算高危，但为了安全起见，我应该先列出点和当前历史配置，然后向用户确认。另外，用户还提到\"导出来\"。我需要理解\"导出来\"是什么意思。可能是将历史配置导出？但当前工具中没有导出功能。可能用户是想查看历史配置的列表，或者将配置导出到文件。我需要澄清这一点。首先，列出所有点。然后列出当前历史配置。之后向用户确认是否真的要为所有点添加历史记录，并询问\"导出来\"的具体含义。让我先调用 list_points。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1819, "output_tokens": 258, "latency_ms": 9181.542000000263, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户希望给全厂所有点添加历史记录并导出。当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，可用工具是manage_history和manage_points。\n\n首先需要列出所有点位，但manage_points的list_points操作需要type_filter参数，且必须为'analog'、'digital'或'string'。用户说\"全厂所有的点\"，我需要确认点的类型。我可以分别查询三种类型，或者询问用户。但根据行为准则，如果信息不足，先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。我可以先尝试查询所有模拟量点，因为工业SCADA中模拟量点通常最常见，但最好还是询问用户以确保准确。\n\n同时，我需要列出当前的历史配置，了解已有哪些点配置了历史记录。这样我才能知道哪些点需要添加。我已经调用过list_history，结果显示count: 0，histories: []，说明目前没有任何历史配置。\n\n因此，我需要先获取所有点位信息。我可以分别查询三种类型的点位，这样能覆盖所有点。让我先查询模拟量点。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2149, "output_tokens": 299, "latency_ms": 11842.47940000023, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想把所有点都加上历史记录并导出。当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，可用工具有manage_history（list_history, enable_history, set_retention）和manage_points（list_points）。\n\n首先需要列出所有点，但manage_points的list_points需要type_filter参数。用户说\"全厂所有的点\"，我需要获取所有类型的点。可以尝试分别获取analog、digital、string三种类型的点，然后为每个点启用历史记录。\n\n但问题是，工具一次只能处理一个点，而且用户还要求\"导出来\"。可能需要先列出所有点，然后逐个启用历史记录。不过enable_history工具每次只能为一个tag启用历史记录。如果点很多，这会很繁琐。\n\n另外，用户提到\"导出来\"，这可能意味着需要将历史配置导出为某种格式，但当前工具中没有导出功能。或许用户是希望看到配置结果，或者需要将配置保存下来。\n\n让我先尝试列出所有点。我需要知道有哪些点才能进行配置。先尝试不带type_filter参数？从之前的错误看，type_filter是必需的，必须为'analog'、'digital'或'string'之一。那我就分别查询这三种类型。\n\n先查询analog点。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2520, "output_tokens": 452, "latency_ms": 20917.741600000227, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我注意到manage_points工具在调用时返回了schema错误。错误信息说\"type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"。但我传入的就是\"analog\"啊。让我仔细看看工具定义...在工具定义中，type_filter是字符串类型，没有枚举约束。但实际调用时似乎有枚举验证。也许我需要直接传字符串\"analog\"而不带引号？不过JSON中本来就是字符串。或者可能是工具实现有问题。\n\n既然manage_points不可用，我应该专注于当前阶段可用的工具：manage_history。用户想给所有点加上历史记录，但我首先需要知道有哪些点。也许我可以先查询当前的历史配置来了解情况。\n\n让我再调用一次manage_history，这次可能已经有一些历史配置了。不过刚才调用时返回的是空列表。但用户说\"全厂所有的点\"，也许系统中已经有了一些点，只是没有配置历史记录。\n\n实际上，在CONFIG_HISTORY阶段，我只能使用manage_history工具。而manage_history只有list_history和enable_history两个动作。enable_history可以为指定tag添加历史配置。但我不知道有哪些tag。也许我可以从manage_points获取，但manage_points似乎有问题。\n\n也许我应该询问用户具体的点名。但用户说\"全厂所有的点\"，这意味着我需要知道所有点的名称。\n\n让我再尝试一次manage_points，也许参数格式有问题。我直接传\"analog\"作为字符串。等等，错误信息说\"Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"，这看起来像是Pydantic的错误，说明验证期望的是这三个值之一，但可能我的输入格式有问题。也许我需要确保它是有效的JSON字符串。\n\n让我重新构建请求，确保完全正确。使用双引号。或者可能工具定义中的type_filter实际有枚举约束但没有在schema中显示。让我尝试传入一个空字符串试试。或者干脆不传这个参数？但schema中没有标记为required，所以可能可以不传。让我试试不带type_filter。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3044, "output_tokens": 442, "latency_ms": 17165.02870000113, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户让我帮忙把全厂所有的点都加上历史，然后导出来。当前阶段是CONFIG_HISTORY，可用工具有manage_history和manage_points。manage_points的list_points似乎有问题，每次调用都返回schema错误，说type_filter必须是'analog'、'digital'或'string'。我已经尝试了不带type_filter，带type_filter='analog'，都不行。可能工具实现有问题。但我需要列出点才能知道哪些点需要加历史。\n\n也许我可以换个思路：直接调用manage_history的enable_history？但需要tag参数，我不知道具体有哪些tag。或者我可以用list_history看看有没有已配置的历史记录，之前调用过一次，返回count:0，histories:[]，说明没有配置任何历史记录。\n\n用户想要\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史\"，这意味着我需要先知道有哪些点。但manage_points工具似乎有bug。也许我可以尝试用不同的参数组合？或者询问用户提供点列表？\n\n不过，作为助手，我应该尝试解决问题。让我仔细看看错误信息：\"list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"。这看起来像是Pydantic验证错误，说明type_filter字段期望这三种值之一，但可能我传的值不对。我试过\"analog\"，也许需要传其他值？但文档说type_filter是字符串，可选值为'analog'、'digital'或'string'。我已经传了'analog'啊。\n\n等等，也许工具定义中type_filter的类型是字符串，但实际实现中可能期望一个枚举值？或者我需要传一个实际的字符串值？让我尝试传\"analog\"（带双引号），在JSON中已经是这样了。\n\n也许我应该尝试其他type_filter值，比如\"string\"或\"digital\"，看看是否可行。但用户想要所有点，我需要分别查询三种类型。\n\n让我尝试\"string\"类型："}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3558, "output_tokens": 385, "latency_ms": 14372.240699998656, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "manage_points工具似乎有问题，总是返回schema错误。让我尝试用不同的方式。也许问题不在参数，而是工具本身。但既然manage_history的list_history可以工作，我可以先查看历史配置。不过用户需要\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史\"，这意味着需要知道所有点。\n\n或许我可以假设用户已经知道点名？或者我可以要求用户提供点列表。但根据行为准则，信息不足时应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。\n\nmanage_points工具似乎无法正常工作。也许我可以切换到另一个阶段？根据当前阶段，可切换的下一阶段有：CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, VALIDATE。CONFIG_SCRIPT阶段可能有其他工具？但用户需求是配置历史记录，所以应该留在CONFIG_HISTORY阶段。\n\n也许我误解了工具调用方式。让我检查manage_points的工具定义：它需要action参数，type_filter是可选参数。但错误信息显示type_filter期望'analog'、'digital'或'string'，我已经尝试了这些值。\n\n等等，错误信息说\"Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"，但也许它期望的是一个列表？或者我需要传一个数组？工具定义显示type_filter是字符串类型，可选值为'analog'、'digital'或'string'。\n\n也许我需要使用不同的参数名？让我查看工具定义：type_filter是字符串，可选值为'analog'、'digital'或'string'。我已经尝试了。\n\n也许工具实现有问题。既然manage_history可以工作，我可以尝试用list_history查看现有配置。然后要求用户提供点名。\n\n让我先列出历史配置，然后询问用户具体点名。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4003, "output_tokens": 598, "latency_ms": 21084.104800000205, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您好！我注意到当前存在两个问题：\n\n1. **工具限制问题**：在当前 `CONFIG_HISTORY` 阶段，我无法通过 `manage_points` 工具获取全厂点位列表（该工具持续返回 schema 错误）\n2. **功能限制问题**：历史记录配置工具 `manage_history` 当前只支持 `list_history`（查看配置）和 `enable_history`（为单个标签启用历史），没有批量配置或导出功能\n\n**为了继续您的需求，我需要您的协助：**\n\n**方案一（推荐）**：请提供您需要配置历史记录的点位标签列表，例如：\n- `[\"TEMP_001\", \"PRESS_002\", \"FLOW_003\", ...]`\n\n**方案二**：如果您能获取点位列表，我可以：\n1. 使用 `enable_history` 为每个点位逐一配置历史记录\n2. 配置完成后，通过 `list_history` 查看所有配置\n\n**关于\"导出来\"**：目前工具没有直接导出功能，但配置完成后，我可以为您提供所有历史配置的完整列表，这相当于配置的\"导出\"。\n\n请提供点位列表，或者告诉我您希望如何继续。", "reasoning": "我注意到manage_points工具持续报错，但manage_history工具工作正常。用户要求\"把全厂所有的点都加上历史，然后导出来\"。\n\n首先，我需要理解当前状况：\n1. 目前没有任何历史配置（count: 0）\n2. manage_points工具似乎有schema问题，但这是唯一能获取点位列表的工具\n3. 用户想要为所有点添加历史记录\n\n由于manage_points工具持续报错，我需要考虑其他方案。用户可能期望我：\n1. 尝试不同的参数组合来获取点位列表\n2. 或者询问用户提供点位信息\n\n让我再仔细看看错误信息：\"list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"。这似乎表明type_filter参数必须严格匹配这三个值之一，但即使我提供了正确的值，仍然报错。可能是工具实现有问题。\n\n考虑到用户明确要求\"全厂所有的点\"，我需要先获取点位列表。既然直接调用工具失败，我可以：\n1. 向用户说明问题，询问点位列表\n2. 尝试其他方法\n\n根据行为准则，当信息不足时，应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。我已经尝试了多次，现在应该向用户说明情况。\n\n另外，用户要求\"导出来\"，这可能意味着需要某种导出功能。但当前工具没有直接导出功能，我需要先完成历史配置，然后考虑如何\"导出\"。\n\n让我向用户说明当前情况，并询问点位信息。同时，我需要提到当前阶段的限制。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "HistoryQuery"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 19780, "output_tokens": 3159, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 121299.9920000002}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "82cf55e5-5737-4d3a-8409-f9572ae9f648", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:475acf1b138c3254241ea5bc9e3026b3872809cbc539ca060c86f7f668b25a23", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-016", "text": "在chemical screen加个tank，绑到TI-201上，另外加个button用于start", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "graphics"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:36.506Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T06:45:40.020Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "MANAGE_PAGES", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:36.506Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:41.549Z"}, {"name": "GENERATE_LAYOUT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:41.549Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:45:04.494Z"}, {"name": "BIND_POINTS", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:45:04.494Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:45:40.020Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:45:40.020Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:45:40.020Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "MANAGE_PAGES", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_widget", "create_page", "list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "chem_screen", "name": "chemical screen"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8295999996335013, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "BIND_POINTS", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_text", "create_line", "group_widgets", "set_widget_style", "apply_flow_layout"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "chem_screen", "name": "chemical screen"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4510000000882428, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_hash": "sha256:fcecac1dae4dfaf00fb3049afcbdce0448e44c2f01436ef07ea9f3346a61faab", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1298, "output_tokens": 100, "latency_ms": 5039.342800000668, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我先查看现有的页面列表，找到 chemical screen 的页面 ID。", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Add a tank widget on the \"chemical screen\" page, bound to point TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nFirst, I need to list the existing pages to find the \"chemical screen\" page and get its page_id."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2059, "output_tokens": 755, "latency_ms": 22941.85870000001, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前阶段（GENERATE_LAYOUT）的可用工具，我只能操作以下图形元素：\n- **create_text**：创建静态文本标签\n- **create_line**：绘制线条（如管道段）\n- **group_widgets**：分组已有组件\n- **set_widget_style**：设置样式\n- **apply_flow_layout**：应用流式布局\n\n**当前工具不支持创建 Tank（储罐）和 Button（按钮）组件**，也无法执行点位绑定操作。\n\n---\n\n### 需要的操作与建议\n\n| 需求 | 所需能力 | 当前阶段可用？ |\n|------|----------|----------------|\n| 创建 Tank 组件 | 创建 HMI 控件 | ❌ 不可用 |\n| 创建 Button 组件 | 创建 HMI 控件 | ❌ 不可用 |\n| 绑定 Tank 到 TI-201 | 点位绑定 (BIND_POINTS) | ❌ 需切换阶段 |\n\n---\n\n### 建议后续步骤\n\n1. **切换到 BIND_POINTS 阶段** —— 如果 Tank 和 Button 组件已经存在于页面中，可在该阶段进行点位绑定\n2. **使用其他工具创建组件** —— 需要一个支持 `create_widget` 的工具来创建 Tank 和 Button\n\n如果你希望我先切换到 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段查看是否有更多可用工具，请告诉我。或者，如果这些组件已经存在于页面中，请提供它们的 widget ID，我可以在当前阶段帮助你进行样式调整和布局。\n\nnext_state: BIND_POINTS", "reasoning": "Now I know the page_id is \"chem_screen\". The user wants to:\n1. Add a tank widget bound to TI-201\n2. Add a button widget for \"start\"\n\nHowever, looking at the current available tools in the GENERATE_LAYOUT phase:\n- manage_graphics: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n\nNone of these tools allow me to create a tank widget or a button widget. The manage_graphics tool only supports creating text labels and lines. There's no \"create_widget\" or \"create_tank\" or \"create_button\" action available.\n\nCreating a tank and a button would typically require a tool like manage_widgets or similar that can create HMI widgets. But this is not available in the current phase.\n\nThe user also wants to bind the tank to TI-201, which would be a point binding operation - this would typically be done in the BIND_POINTS phase.\n\nSince I cannot create a tank or button widget with the current available tools, I should:\n1. Inform the user that the current phase tools don't support creating tank/button widgets\n2. Suggest switching to a different phase that might have the appropriate tools\n\nLooking at the available next states: BIND_POINTS, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nWait, let me reconsider. Maybe the widgets already exist and I just need to manage their layout? Or maybe I need to use create_text and create_line to simulate a tank? That seems like a workaround rather than the proper approach.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the tools - there's no widget creation tool for tanks or buttons. The current phase (GENERATE_LAYOUT) seems focused on text labels, lines, grouping, styling, and layout management.\n\nI should inform the user that with the current available tools in this phase, I cannot create a tank widget or a button widget. I can only create text labels and lines. The user might need to use a different tool or phase to create these widgets.\n\nLet me be honest with the user about the limitations."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2840, "output_tokens": 524, "latency_ms": 17752.658399998836, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我查看一下当前 BIND_POINTS 阶段的可用工具，确认是否支持点位绑定和组件创建功能。", "reasoning": "The user has entered the BIND_POINTS phase. Let me check what tools are available now. According to the system prompt, the current available tools are still:\n- manage_graphics: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n\nWait, the prompt says \"你已进入 BIND_POINTS 阶段\" but the available tools listed are still the same as before. This seems like a contradiction - I'm in BIND_POINTS phase but the tools haven't changed to include point binding capabilities.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the original prompt:\n- 【当前阶段】BIND_POINTS\n- 【可切换的下一阶段】DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n- 【当前可用工具】manage_graphics, manage_pages\n\nSo even in BIND_POINTS phase, the available tools are still the same - they only support creating text, lines, grouping, styling, and layout. There's no explicit \"bind_point\" tool available.\n\nThis is confusing. The phase is called BIND_POINTS but there's no tool to actually bind points. Let me think about this...\n\nMaybe the user message \"你已进入 BIND_POINTS 阶段，请使用当前可用工具继续完成任务。\" is simulating a workflow where I should proceed with what's available.\n\nGiven the constraints:\n1. I cannot create tank or button widgets (not supported by current tools)\n2. I cannot bind points to widgets (no bind_points tool available)\n3. I can only create text labels, lines, group widgets, set styles, and apply layouts\n\nI should inform the user honestly that even in the BIND_POINTS phase, the available tools don't include the ability to:\n1. Create tank/button widgets\n2. Bind points to widgets\n\nHowever, I can create text labels as placeholders and use lines to draw a simple representation. But that's not really a proper tank widget.\n\n\nI need to be straightforward with the user about what I can and cannot do with the current toolset. The manage_pages and manage_graphics tools don't provide widget creation or point binding capabilities, so I can't fulfill the original request for a tank widget bound to TI-201 or a start button. I can only work with text labels, lines, grouping, styling, and layouts at this stage."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2704, "output_tokens": 571, "latency_ms": 17764.656299999842, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前 BIND_POINTS 阶段的可用工具，我进行了全面检查：\n\n| 工具 | 可用操作 | 是否支持任务需求 |\n|------|----------|------------------|\n| manage_graphics | create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout | ❌ 无法创建 Tank/Button |\n| manage_pages | list_pages | ❌ 仅查看页面列表 |\n\n---\n\n### 当前阶段的局限性\n\n即使在 **BIND_POINTS** 阶段，现有工具仍然**不支持**：\n\n1. ❌ **创建 Tank（储罐）组件** —— 无 create_widget / create_tank 工具\n2. ❌ **创建 Button（按钮）组件** —— 无 create_button 工具  \n3. ❌ **绑定点位到组件** —— 无 bind_point 工具\n\n---\n\n### 我能做的\n\n使用现有工具，我可以：\n- 在 chem_screen 页面添加**文本标签**（如 \"TI-201\"、\"START\"）\n- 绘制**线条**作为示意管道\n- 进行**分组**和**样式**设置\n\n但这**不是**真正的 Tank/Button 控件，也无法绑定实际点位。\n\n---\n\n### 建议\n\n要完成你的需求（添加 Tank 绑定 TI-201 + Start 按钮），需要一个支持以下功能的工具：\n```\n- create_widget(type=\"tank\", ...)\n- create_widget(type=\"button\", ...)  \n- bind_point(widget_id, property, tag)\n```\n\n**请问是否有其他工具或配置方式可以使用？** 或者你希望我先用文本标签和线条创建一个示意布局？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user is telling me I'm in the BIND_POINTS phase again. Let me look at the available tools more carefully:\n\nCurrent available tools:\n- manage_graphics: create_text, create_line, group_widgets, set_widget_style, apply_flow_layout\n- manage_pages: list_pages\n\nEven in BIND_POINTS phase, I don't have a \"bind_point\" tool or any tool that can:\n1. Create tank widgets\n2. Create button widgets\n3. Bind points to widgets\n\nThe current tools are limited to:\n- Text creation\n- Line creation\n- Widget grouping\n- Style setting\n- Layout application\n- Page listing\n\nI need to be honest with the user that the current toolset doesn't support their requirements. I should explain what's missing and what they need.\n\nActually, I should stop repeating the same response. The system keeps telling me I'm in BIND_POINTS phase, but the tools available don't include binding functionality. I should clearly state that I cannot complete this task with the current tools and explain why."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "ChemicalProductionScreen"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 8901, "output_tokens": 1950, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 63513.67399999981}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "c59a7694-3520-41ce-8513-14ffcd40bd63", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:475acf1b138c3254241ea5bc9e3026b3872809cbc539ca060c86f7f668b25a23", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 2, "seed": 44}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-017", "text": "帮我把全厂所有的点都加上历史，然后导出来", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "history"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:17.247Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T06:46:05.356Z", "total_turns": 6, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:17.247Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:29.353Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_HISTORY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T06:44:29.353Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T06:46:05.356Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_history", "action": "list_history", "args": {"action": "list_history", "enabled_only": "False"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "histories": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8844999993016245, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "None"}, "schema_valid": false, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "SCHEMA_ERROR", "error_msg": "list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0