[], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "BIND_POINTS", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_trends", "allowed_actions": ["enable_trend_scroll", "create_trend_group", "delete_trend_group", "list_trend_groups", "add_trend_pen"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["create_script"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["create_schedule"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["set_retention", "disable_history", "query_history"]}, {"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["create_page"]}, {"name": "manage_databases", "allowed_actions": ["create_database_table"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["create_point"]}, {"name": "manage_graphics", "allowed_actions": ["create_rect", "create_text"]}], "visible_count": 8, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points", "type_filter": "analog"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 0, "points": []}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.6545000014739344, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 960, "output_tokens": 395, "latency_ms": 13688.548099999025, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想创建一个趋势页面，并添加一个趋势图表来绑定历史数据。当前工作流是PointBinding，步骤是list_targets，这意味着我们处于分析意图阶段。\n\n根据行为准则，我需要先分析用户意图。用户想要：\n1. 创建一个趋势页面（trend page）\n2. 添加趋势图表（trend chart）\n3. 绑定历史数据\n\n这涉及到页面管理和点位绑定。当前可用的工具只有`manage_pages`（仅支持`list_pages`操作）和`manage_points`（仅支持`list_points`操作）。\n\n要完成用户的需求，我需要：\n1. 创建页面 - 但`manage_pages`目前只支持`list_pages`，不支持创建页面。\n2. 添加图表 - 同样，没有支持添加图表的工具。\n3. 绑定历史数据 - 可能需要查看现有的点位。\n\n由于当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，我需要切换到其他阶段。根据可切换的下一阶段列表，我可以选择：`ASK_USER`、`BIND_POINTS`、`CONFIG_ALARM`、`CONFIG_HISTORY`、`CONFIG_POINT`、`CONFIG_SCRIPT`、`DEPLOY`、`DONE`、`GENERATE_LAYOUT`、`MANAGE_PAGES`、`VALIDATE`。\n\n对于创建趋势页面和图表，`MANAGE_PAGES`阶段可能更合适，但我不确定该阶段是否有更多工具。也许`CONFIG_HISTORY`阶段可以用来配置历史数据绑定。\n\n首先，我应该查看现有的页面和点位，了解当前配置。让我调用`list_pages`和`list_points`来获取信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1639, "output_tokens": 104, "latency_ms": 4778.160699999717, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我需要继续在BIND_POINTS阶段完成任务。当前可用的工具是manage_pages和manage_points，但manage_pages只支持list_pages和bind_point操作，manage_points只支持list_points操作。用户想创建trend page并添加trend chart绑定历史数据。\n\n首先，我需要查看有哪些点位可供绑定。先调用list_points，不带type_filter参数。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4868, "output_tokens": 515, "latency_ms": 17218.301599999904, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The user wants to create a trend page and add a trend chart bound to historical data. I'm currently in the BIND_POINTS phase with access to manage_pages and manage_points. \n\nFrom the tool list, I see:\n- manage_pages: list_pages, bind_point\n- manage_points: list_points\n\nBut the user wants to create a trend page and trend chart. Looking at the available tools more carefully, I should be using manage_trends which can:\n- create_trend_group: Create a new trend curve group on an HMI page.\n- add_trend_pen: Add a data pen (curve) to an trend group.\n\nHowever, I'm in the BIND_POINTS phase. Let me re-read the context...\n\nThe workflow context says: current workflow=PointBinding, step=list_targets\n\nBut the system message says I'm in BIND_POINTS phase with these tools:\n- manage_pages: list_pages, bind_point\n- manage_points: list_points\n\nWait, the user message says \"你已进入 BIND_POINTS 阶段\" which means I've entered the BIND_POINTS phase. But the available tools listed initially include manage_trends with create_trend_group and add_trend_pen capabilities.\n\nLooking at the function definitions at the top, manage_trends is available with actions like create_trend_group and add_trend_pen. But the BIND_POINTS phase description says the available tools are only manage_pages and manage_points.\n\nHmm, there seems to be a conflict. The initial system message lists all available tools including manage_trends, but the BIND_POINTS phase restriction says only manage_pages and manage_points are available.\n\nLet me think about what the user actually wants:\n1. Create a trend page (this would require creating a page first)\n2. Add a trend chart on that page\n3. Bind historical data to it\n\nFor step 1, I need to use manage_pages. But manage_pages only supports list_pages and bind_point - not create_page.\n\nFor step 2, I would need manage_trends to create a trend group and add pens.\n\n\nSince the phase restricts my available actions, I should work within those constraints. I'll start by checking what pages exist and what points are available to understand the current setup, then explain the limitations to the user."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5485, "output_tokens": 537, "latency_ms": 15886.051600000428, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我理解您的需求：创建一个趋势页面并添加趋势图表来绑定历史数据。\n\n不过，**当前 BIND_POINTS 阶段的可用工具只有**：\n- `manage_pages`：仅支持 `list_pages`、`bind_point` 操作\n- `manage_points`：仅支持 `list_points` 操作\n\n**无法完成您的需求**，因为缺少以下能力：\n1. ❌ 创建页面（需要 `create_page` 操作）\n2. ❌ 创建趋势图表组（需要 `manage_trends` 工具的 `create_trend_group`）\n3. ❌ 添加趋势曲线/笔（需要 `manage_trends` 工具的 `add_trend_pen`）\n\n**建议**：切换到 `MANAGE_PAGES` 阶段来创建页面，之后再切换到能够配置趋势曲线的阶段。\n\n让我为您切换到合适的阶段：\n\nnext_state: MANAGE_PAGES", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a trend page and add a trend chart bound to historical data. I'm in the BIND_POINTS phase, and the current available tools are manage_pages and manage_points.\n\nHowever, looking at the tools:\n- manage_pages currently only allows: list_pages, bind_point\n- manage_points currently only allows: list_points\n\nNeither of these tools can create a page or create a trend group. To fulfill the user's request, I would need:\n1. To create a page - but manage_pages doesn't have a \"create_page\" action available in this phase\n2. To create a trend group - but that's in manage_trends which is not available in this phase\n3. To add trend pens - also in manage_trends\n\nThe current BIND_POINTS phase tools are insufficient for creating trend pages and charts. According to my behavior guidelines:\n\"6. 若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"\n\nThe available next states are: ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\nTo create pages and trend charts, I should switch to MANAGE_PAGES phase which would give me access to create_page functionality. Or I could switch to a phase where manage_trends is available.\n\nLet me explain to the user that the current phase doesn't have the tools needed, and suggest switching to MANAGE_PAGES to create the page first, and then we'd need a phase that allows trend creation."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 12952, "output_tokens": 1551, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 51594.29730000011}, "judge": null}
