owed_actions": ["create_script", "enable_script"]}, {"name": "manage_reports", "allowed_actions": ["create_report_template"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["disable_history"]}, {"name": "manage_schedules", "allowed_actions": ["enable_schedule", "create_schedule"]}], "visible_count": 7, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "create_point", "args": {"action": "create_point", "tag": "PUMP_CTRL", "type": "digital", "description": "泵启停控制", "address": "DB1.0"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": false, "error_code": "ALREADY_EXISTS", "error_msg": "point PUMP_CTRL already exists", "result_data": {}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.3003000003664056, "intended_entities": ["points.PUMP_CTRL"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:43d4f3e3424d08e6d0df74e774e92c960d43209e2c18f450ef8c3b2b7ba60734", "final_hash": "sha256:14cf194ff434045068049a99192b714bdec26b244d464dd3c55e2da123eac394", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 437, "latency_ms": 16550.87900000035, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，包含启停控制，并且要配置报警。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，需要分析用户意图。\n\n用户的需求是：\n1. 创建泵站控制台（HMI页面）\n2. 包含启停控制（需要控制点位）\n3. 全套搞定（可能包括页面、点位、绑定、脚本等）\n4. 配置报警\n\n当前可用的工具只有manage_points（只能list_points）和manage_pages（只能list_pages）。这些是查询工具，不能创建或修改任何内容。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换到合适的阶段。\n\n可切换的下一阶段包括：ASK_USER, BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_ALARM, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_POINT, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, GENERATE_LAYOUT, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE\n\n对于这个需求：\n- 需要创建点位 → CONFIG_POINT\n- 需要创建页面和控件 → MANAGE_PAGES 或 GENERATE_LAYOUT\n- 需要配置报警 → CONFIG_ALARM\n- 需要绑定点位到控件 → BIND_POINTS\n- 可能需要脚本控制 → CONFIG_SCRIPT\n\n由于用户说\"全套搞定\"，可能需要多个步骤。但首先应该进入哪个阶段呢？\n\n当前工作流上下文是workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points。这表明当前是在报警配置工作流的\"发现点位\"步骤。所以可能需要先发现/列出点位，然后再配置报警。\n\n但用户要的是从头开始创建泵站控制台，不仅仅是报警配置。\n\n让我先调用可用的查询工具来了解当前系统中已有的点位和页面，然后根据情况建议切换到合适的阶段。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4176, "output_tokens": 431, "latency_ms": 14935.42940000043, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前系统中还没有任何点位和页面。要创建泵站控制台并配置报警，需要从头开始搭建整个系统。\n\n我建议按以下步骤进行：\n1. **配置点位** - 创建泵的启停控制点、运行状态点、故障点等\n2. **创建页面** - 制作泵站控制台HMI页面\n3. **添加控件** - 放置启停按钮、状态指示灯、泵图形等\n4. **绑定点位** - 将控件与点位关联\n5. **配置报警** - 设置故障报警、状态变化报警等\n\n由于当前阶段的可用工具只能查询，无法进行配置，我建议先切换到**CONFIG_POINT**阶段开始创建点位。\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_POINT", "reasoning": "当前系统中没有任何点位和页面。用户需要从头开始创建泵站控制台。\n\n用户需要：\n1. 点位配置（泵的启停控制点、状态点、报警点等）\n2. 页面创建（控制台页面）\n3. 控件创建（启停按钮、状态指示灯等）\n4. 报警配置\n5. 绑定和脚本\n\n当前阶段ANALYZE_INTENT的可用工具只有查询工具，无法满足创建需求。需要切换到其他阶段。\n\n应该切换到哪个阶段呢？用户说\"全套搞定\"，所以需要一个全面的配置流程。可能需要按顺序进行：\n1. CONFIG_POINT - 先配置点位\n2. MANAGE_PAGES - 创建页面和控件\n3. BIND_POINTS - 绑定点位到控件\n4. CONFIG_ALARM - 配置报警\n5. CONFIG_SCRIPT - 可能需要脚本\n\n但用户可能希望一步到位。我可以建议切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段开始创建点位。\n\n根据行为准则第5条，我可以在回复中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换阶段。\n\n让我先回复用户，说明当前情况，然后建议切换到CONFIG_POINT阶段开始创建点位。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4622, "output_tokens": 445, "latency_ms": 12022.608499999478, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在我进入了CONFIG_POINT阶段。让我查看当前可用的工具：manage_points, manage_alarms, manage_pages, manage_graphics, manage_schedules, manage_scripts, manage_reports, manage_history。\n\n对于泵站控制台，我需要创建以下点位：\n1. 泵启停控制点（布尔量，数字输出）\n2. 泵运行状态点（布尔量，数字输入）\n3. 泵故障点（布尔量，数字输入）\n4. 可能还需要一些模拟量点，如压力、流量等\n\n让我先创建这些点位。我将使用manage_points工具的create_point动作。\n\n首先创建泵控制相关的点位：\n1. PUMP_CTRL - 泵启停控制（数字输出）\n2. PUMP_RUN - 泵运行状态（数字输入）\n3. PUMP_FAULT - 泵故障（数字输入）\n4. PUMP_PRESSURE - 泵出口压力（模拟输入）\n5. PUMP_FLOW - 泵流量（模拟输入）\n\n我将依次创建这些点位。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5186, "output_tokens": 355, "latency_ms": 19366.773300000204, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户需要我创建泵站控制台并配置报警。当前处于 CONFIG_POINT 阶段，我需要先创建点位。\n\n根据之前的错误，manage_points 工具需要 `type` 字段而不是 `point_type`。让我查看工具定义：\n\n- manage_points 当前允许 actions: create_point\n- 参数包括：action, tag, type, description, address\n\n让我重新创建泵站所需的点位：\n\n1. 泵启停控制点（数字量输出）\n2. 泵运行状态点（数字量输入）\n3. 泵故障信号（数字量输入）\n4. 泵出口压力（模拟量输入）\n5. 泵流量（模拟量输入）\n\n我需要使用正确的参数格式来创建这些点位。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5660, "output_tokens": 179, "latency_ms": 6295.4246000008425, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我再次检查工具定义，发现 manage_points 的 create_point action 需要一个 \"type\" 字段，而不是 \"point_type\"。让我看看参数结构：\n\n从工具定义中：\n- tag (required)\n- type (required) - 点类型，如 'analog', 'digital', 'string'\n- description (optional)\n- address (optional)\n\n我之前的调用中确实用了 \"type\": \"digital\"，但仍然报错说 \"type: Field required\"。这可能是因为参数传递的问题。\n\n让我尝试用不同的方式调用，确保参数正确传递。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5898, "output_tokens": 195, "latency_ms": 8315.616800000498, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户再次让我进入CONFIG_POINT阶段。我需要创建点位。让我再看一下工具定义：\n\nmanage_points: Point CRUD, area assignment, faceplate binding.\nCurrently allowed actions:\n- create_point: Create a new SCADA point.\n\nParameters:\n- action: required, \"create_point\"\n- tag: required, string\n- type: required, string - 点类型，如 'analog', 'digital', 'string'\n- description: optional, string\n- address: optional, string\n\n我之前的尝试失败了，错误是 \"create_point.type: Field required\"。让我检查参数名是否正确。在JSON schema中，参数名是\"type\"，类型是string。\n\n让我再试一次，确保参数格式正确。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6152, "output_tokens": 381, "latency_ms": 11502.108299999236, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "让我仔细看一下工具定义。manage_points 工具的 create_point action 需要的参数是：\n\n- action: \"create_point\" (required)\n- tag: string (required)\n- type: string (required) - 点类型，如 'analog', 'digital', 'string'\n- description: string (optional)\n- address: string (optional)\n\n我之前的调用是正确的，但是系统报错说 \"create_point.type: Field required\"。这很奇怪。\n\n让我再仔细看看工具的 schema：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"title\": \"create_point\",\n  \"description\": \"Create a new SCADA point.\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"const\": \"create_point\"},\n    \"tag\": {\"title\": \"Tag\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"type\": {\"description\": \"e.g. 'analog', 'digital', 'string'\", \"title\": \"Type\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"description\": {\"title\": \"Description\", \"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"address\": {\"title\": \"Address\", \"type\": \"string\"}\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"tag\", \"type\", \"action\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}\n```\n\n我看到 required 是 [\"tag\", \"type\", \"action\"]，我确实提供了这三个字段。\n\n可能问题是工具调用时参数传递的方式？让我再试一次，确保参数正确传递。\n\n或者可能是系统问题？让我尝试更简单的调用。\n\n我会用最简化的参数格式，确保所有必需字段都正确传递。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6592, "output_tokens": 192, "latency_ms": 7572.563699999591, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我注意到一个问题：manage_points 工具的参数定义中，create_point 动作需要 type 字段，但错误提示说 \"create_point.type: Field required\"。\n\n让我仔细看一下工具定义：\n- action: \"create_point\" \n- tag: string\n- type: string (例如 'analog', 'digital', 'string')\n- description: optional\n- address: optional\n\n我一直在调用时包含 type 字段，但仍然报错。可能工具定义有问题，或者我需要用不同的方式传递参数。\n\n让我尝试用最简单的方式，只传递必需的字段。"}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6843, "output_tokens": 557, "latency_ms": 20794.373200000337, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我注意到当前阶段虽然名为 CONFIG_POINT，但 `manage_points` 工具当前只允许 `list_points` 操作，无法创建新的点位。\n\n要继续完成泵站控制台的配置，需要先切换到可以执行 `create_point` 操作的阶段。我建议切换到 **CONFIG_POINT** 的可写阶段来创建点位。", "reasoning": "The user keeps telling me I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage and to use the available tools. I've tried multiple times to create a point using manage_points with the action \"create_point\" and providing the \"type\" field, but I keep getting a SCHEMA_ERROR saying \"create_point.type: Field required\".\n\nLet me look at the tool definition again more carefully:\n\n```\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"title\": \"create_point\", \"description\": \"Create a new SCADA point.\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"const\": \"create_point\"}, \"tag\": {\"title\": \"Tag\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"description\": \"e.g. 'analog', 'digital', 'string'\", \"title\": \"Type\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"description\": {\"title\": \"Description\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"address\": {\"title\": \"Address\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"tag\", \"type\", \"action\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}\n```\n\nSo \"type\" is indeed required. I've been passing it. Maybe there's an issue with how I'm structuring the call?\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the issue is with the parameter structure or there's something about the \"type\" field that's being interpreted incorrectly. \n\nActually, looking at the system prompt again - it says the current stage is CONFIG_POINT, and the available tool is manage_points with only \"list_points\" action allowed. But then in the tool definition it shows more actions including \"create_point\".\n\nWait, I see the issue now. The system prompt says:\n\"- manage_points: Point CRUD, area assignment, faceplate binding.; 当前允许 actions: list_points\"\n\nThis means only \"list_points\" is currently allowed! I cannot use \"create_point\" action in this stage!\n\nThe system is telling me I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage but the allowed action is only \"list_points\". This is contradictory. \n\nThe user keeps telling me to use the tools, but I can only list points, not create them. I need to switch to a different stage where I can actually create points, or the current stage needs to allow the create_point action."}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7459, "output_tokens": 487, "latency_ms": 20051.00820000007, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "I see that the user keeps reminding me that I'm in CONFIG_POINT stage. I've been trying to call manage_points with action \"create_point\" but keep getting a SCHEMA_ERROR saying \"create_point.ty