eason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，包含启停控制功能，还要配置报警。当前阶段是ANALYZE_INTENT，我需要分析用户意图并确定下一步。\n\n首先，用户需求包括：\n1. 创建泵站控制台（HMI页面）\n2. 启停控制功能（需要绑定点位）\n3. 报警配置\n\n根据当前工作流上下文：workflow=AlarmConfig, step=discover_points，以及可用工具只有manage_points（list_points）和manage_pages（list_pages）。这意味着当前阶段主要是发现和列出点位。\n\n我需要先查看现有的点位和页面，以了解当前配置状态，然后决定下一步行动。\n\n让我先调用这两个查询工具来获取信息。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2110, "output_tokens": 232, "latency_ms": 11056.253999999171, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户让我进入 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。现在我在 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，可用工具是 manage_alarms 和 manage_points（仅 list_points 操作）。\n\n我需要先了解现有的点位情况，才能创建报警。之前 list_points 调用因为 type_filter 参数错误失败了。现在重新调用一次，不指定 filter，或者指定正确的 filter。\n\n另外，用户需要创建泵站控制台，带启停控制和报警。但当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，只能创建报警。控制台页面和绑定点位可能需要在后续阶段完成。\n\n我需要先查看现有的点位，然后创建报警。用户没有指定具体哪些点位需要报警，所以我需要询问或者基于泵站的常见配置来创建。\n\n让我先列出所有点位，看看有什么可用的。然后根据泵站的典型需求创建报警：比如压力高/低报警、液位高/低报警、泵运行状态报警等。\n\n调用 list_points 不带 filter。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4270, "output_tokens": 276, "latency_ms": 12593.997399999353, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户在 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段，可用工具有 manage_alarms 和 manage_points（仅 list_points 操作）。但 manage_points 的 list_points 操作需要 type_filter 参数，且必须为 'analog', 'digital' 或 'string'。用户想要创建泵站控制台，带启停控制和报警。报警配置需要点位信息。\n\n首先，我需要创建报警。但我不知道有哪些点位可用。manage_points 的 list_points 需要指定类型过滤器。我可以分别列出 analog、digital 和 string 类型的点位。让我先列出 analog 点位，因为泵站的报警通常基于模拟量（如压力、液位、温度等）。然后再列出 digital 点位，因为启停控制可能涉及数字点位。\n\n调用 manage_points 三次，分别列出三种类型的点位。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4678, "output_tokens": 808, "latency_ms": 32812.300600000526, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户之前想要创建一个泵站控制台，包含启停控制和报警。当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可用的工具是 manage_alarms 和 manage_points（仅 list_points）。但 manage_points 的 list_points 操作需要 type_filter 参数，且必须为 'analog', 'digital' 或 'string'。之前尝试调用 list_points 时，如果不指定 type_filter 会报错，但指定为 'analog' 也报错。可能是参数格式问题？让我再仔细看看工具定义：manage_points 的 list_points 操作中，type_filter 是必需的，且必须是 'analog', 'digital' 或 'string' 之一。之前调用时，我可能传了字符串 \"None\"，而不是 null 或省略？但工具定义说 required: [\"action\", \"type_filter\"]，所以 type_filter 是必须的。之前错误信息是 \"list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"，这说明我传的值不正确。我第一次调用时传了 \"None\"（字符串），第二次传了 \"analog\"，但都报错。可能是我理解有误？让我再看一次工具定义：\n\n```\n\"manage_points\": {\"properties\": {\"action\": {\"const\": \"list_points\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"type_filter\": {\"enum\": [\"analog\", \"digital\", \"string\"], \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"action\", \"type_filter\"], \"type\": \"object\"}\n```\n\n所以 type_filter 必须是枚举值之一。我之前传了 \"analog\" 应该是对的，但为什么报错？可能是工具实现有问题？或者我需要传其他值？错误信息说 \"Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"，这提示我可能需要传小写的 \"analog\"，但我已经传了小写。\n\n也许工具期望的是类型名称，但可能有拼写错误？让我尝试用不同的顺序：先调用 manage_points 列出所有类型，但不行，因为 type_filter 是必需的。\n\n用户想要创建报警，但没有点位信息。我需要先获取点位列表，但工具调用失败。也许我可以直接创建报警？用户说\"弄个泵站的控制台，带上启停控制，全套搞定，再弄个报警\"。这意味着需要创建一个完整的泵站控制台，包括启停控制和报警。但当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，我只能处理报警相关操作。不过，我也能调用 manage_points 的 list_points 来查看点位。\n\n既然 list_points 调用失败，我可能需要假设一些点位存在。但更合理的做法是先创建报警，因为报警配置可能需要点位存在。但如果没有点位，报警无法绑定。\n\n也许用户期望我直接创建报警，即使没有点位。或者我需要先创建点位？但 manage_points 的 list_points 是当前唯一可用的操作，无法创建点位。\n\n可能我需要切换到下一个阶段？根据系统提示，当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可切换的下一阶段包括 BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。也许我应该切换到 BIND_POINTS 或 MANAGE_PAGES 来创建控制台页面和绑定点位。但用户要求\"再弄个报警\"，报警属于当前阶段。我应该先完成报警配置，再切换到其他阶段。\n\n但如果没有点位，报警无法配置。让我尝试用不同的方式调用 list_points。也许 type_filter 参数需要是字符串 \"analog\"，但我已经试过了。让我再试一次，确保拼写正确。"}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5558, "output_tokens": 433, "latency_ms": 15518.07110000118, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "看来 manage_points 工具似乎有问题，每次调用都返回模式错误，即使参数看起来正确。根据工具定义，type_filter 应该是 \"analog\"、\"digital\" 或 \"string\" 之一。我已经尝试了不同的值，但都失败了。\n\n让我检查一下工具调用的格式。我需要确保 JSON 参数是正确的。也许问题在于参数的大小写或格式？让我再试一次，确保参数完全匹配。\n\n实际上，我注意到工具调用中的参数名是 \"type_filter\"，但工具定义中确实有这个参数。让我尝试不提供 type_filter？但根据模式，它是必需的。\n\n等等，也许问题在于工具定义本身？或者可能是调用方式有问题。让我尝试用不同的方式调用，或者也许我需要先创建一些点位？\n\n但根据当前阶段 CONFIG_ALARM，我只能使用 manage_alarms 和 manage_points。我需要先有点位才能创建报警。\n\n让我尝试调用 manage_alarms 来创建一些报警，即使没有点位列表。但报警需要绑定到具体的点位标签。用户提到了泵站的控制台和启停控制，所以应该有相关的点位。\n\n也许我应该假设一些标准的泵站点位名称，比如：\n- 泵运行状态（数字量）\n- 泵故障（数字量）\n- 泵启动/停止控制（数字量）\n- 压力（模拟量）\n- 流量（模拟量）\n- 液位（模拟量）\n\n我可以尝试创建一些报警，使用这些假设的标签名。\n\n但根据行为准则，我应该先调用查询类工具或向用户确认。manage_points 查询失败了，所以我应该向用户确认。\n\n让我向用户询问具体的点位信息。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6054, "output_tokens": 586, "latency_ms": 20719.16929999861, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "当前阶段 CONFIG_ALARM 主要用于配置报警，但创建报警需要先有 SCADA 点位。我尝试查询现有点位时遇到了工具问题，而创建报警时发现点位不存在。\n\n为了完成您的需求（泵站控制台 + 启停控制 + 报警），我们需要先确保基础点位存在。因此我将切换到点位配置阶段，以便为您创建必要的泵站点位（如：泵状态、压力、流量、启停控制等），然后再返回配置报警。\n\nnext_state: BIND_POINTS", "reasoning": "当前阶段是 CONFIG_ALARM，可用工具有 manage_alarms 和 manage_points（仅 list_points 操作）。但 manage_points 的 list_points 操作一直报错，显示 \"list_points.type_filter: Input should be 'analog', 'digital' or 'string'\"。我已经尝试了所有可能的 type_filter 值（analog, digital, string），但都返回同样的错误。这可能意味着工具存在 bug，或者需要其他参数。\n\n不过，我可以使用 manage_alarms 工具。刚才尝试创建数字报警时，返回 \"POINT_NOT_FOUND\" 错误。这说明需要先有点位才能创建报警。\n\n用户想要创建一个泵站控制台，带启停控制和报警。但当前阶段是报警配置，且只能使用这两个工具。我需要先有点位才能创建报警，但 list_points 工具有问题。\n\n也许我可以尝试不使用 type_filter 参数？但根据 JSON schema，type_filter 是必需的。\n\n让我再检查一下工具的 schema。manage_points 的 list_points 操作需要 type_filter 参数，且必须是 \"analog\", \"digital\" 或 \"string\" 之一。我确实提供了正确的值。\n\n可能工具内部有错误。既然无法查询点位，我应该向用户说明情况，并询问是否可以先创建点位，或者提供点位信息。\n\n但用户可能期望我完成整个任务。根据工作流上下文，当前是 AlarmConfig 工作流的 discover_points 步骤。我应该尝试发现点位，但工具不工作。\n\n也许我可以切换到下一个阶段？根据提示，当前阶段 CONFIG_ALARM 可以切换到 BIND_POINTS, CONFIG_HISTORY, CONFIG_SCRIPT, DEPLOY, DONE, MANAGE_PAGES, VALIDATE。\n\n用户需要控制台和报警。控制台属于 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，报警属于 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。但报警需要点位，而点位可能需要在 BIND_POINTS 阶段创建。\n\n让我尝试切换到 BIND_POINTS 阶段，看看是否有创建点位的工具。根据提示，BIND_POINTS 阶段应该有 manage_bindings 工具，可能支持创建点位。\n\n在回复中，我需要包含 \"next_state: BIND_POINTS\" 来切换阶段。同时，向用户说明情况。"}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 6661, "output_tokens": 652, "latency_ms": 19094.39200000088, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户现在进入了 BIND_POINTS 阶段。根据系统提示，当前阶段是 BIND_POINTS，可用工具有 manage_bindings。用户想要创建泵站控制台，需要先创建点位。我应该使用 manage_bindings 工具来创建点位。\n\n首先，我需要为泵站创建基本的点位：\n1. 泵状态（数字量）- PUMP_STATUS_001\n2. 泵故障（数字量）- PUMP_FAULT_001  \n3. 泵启动控制（数字量）- PUMP_START_CMD_001\n4. 泵停止控制（数字量）- PUMP_STOP_CMD_001\n5. 压力（模拟量）- PRESSURE_001\n6. 流量（模拟量）- FLOW_001\n7. 液位（模拟量）- LEVEL_001\n\n然后可以返回 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段创建报警，再进入 MANAGE_PAGES 创建 HMI 页面。\n\n让我开始创建这些点位。使用 manage_bindings 工具的 create_point 操作。"}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 7552, "output_tokens": 562, "latency_ms": 18878.646799999842, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我注意到当前处于 BIND_POINTS 阶段，但系统中没有提供点位管理工具（manage_bindings 工具不可用）。目前可用的工具无法创建 SCADA 点位，而报警配置需要先有存在的点位。\n\n不过，我可以先为您完成其他部分的配置：\n\n1. **创建泵站控制台页面和控件** - 使用 manage_pages\n2. **创建控制脚本** - 使用 manage_scripts\n\n让我先为您创建泵站控制台的 HMI 页面和启停控件：", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to create a pump station control console with start/stop control and alarms. I've gone through several stages:\n\n1. Started in ANALYZE_INTENT stage\n2. Moved to CONFIG_ALARM stage - but couldn't create alarms because points didn't exist\n3. Moved to BIND_POINTS stage - but there's no manage_bindings tool available\n\nLooking at the current situation:\n- I'm in BIND_POINTS stage\n- The available tools listed at the beginning are: manage_alarms, manage_pages, manage_graphics, manage_scripts, manage_reports, manage_history, manage_schedules\n- There is NO manage_bindings tool in the available tools list\n\nThis is a problem - I need to create points first before I can create alarms, but there's no tool to create points.\n\nLet me check what I can do:\n1. manage_pages - can create pages and widgets (create_page, create_widget)\n2. manage_graphics - delete_widget, create_text\n3. manage_alarms - needs points to exist first\n4. manage_scripts - can create scripts\n5. manage_reports - can create report templates\n6. manage_history - can only disable_history\n7. manage_schedules - can create schedules\n\nThe system says I'm in BIND_POINTS stage, but there's no tool to actually bind or create points. This seems like a configuration issue with the tools available.\n\nI should inform the user about this limitation and ask what they'd like to do. I can:\n1. Create the HMI page and widgets for the pump station control console\n2. Create scripts for control logic\n3. But I cannot create the actual points without the proper tool\n\nLet me proceed with what I can do - create the HMI page and widgets, and explain the situation about the missing point creation tool."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 8176, "output_tokens": 1171, "latency_ms": 29156.92889999991, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The page was created successfully. Now I need to add widgets for the pump station control console. Let me add:\n1. A pump widget to show the pump status\n2. Start/Stop buttons\n3. Pressure gauge\n4. Flow meter\n5. Level indicator\n6. Some labels\n\nI'll create these widgets on the page."}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 9816, "output_tokens": 473, "latency_ms": 13301.396099999693, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "我成功创建了泵站控制台页面和控件：\n1. 创建了泵站控制台页面 (page_pump_station_001)\n2. 添加了泵、储罐、压力计、启停按钮等控件\n3. 添加了标题和状态标签\n\n现在我需要：\n1. 创建控制脚本来实现启停逻辑\n2. 创建报警（但需要点位存在）\n\n让我先创建控制脚本，然后尝试创建报警。"}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 10425, "output_tokens": 792, "latency_ms": 22962.87560000019, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我遇到了一个问题：**当前系统中没有可用的 SCADA 点位**，而我目前的工具集（manage_alarms, manage_pages, manage_graphics, manage_scripts 等）无法创建新的点位。\n\n---\n\n## 已完成的工作\n\n✅ **泵站控制台 HMI 页面已创建** (`page_pump_station_001`)\n\n| 组件 | Widget ID | 说明 |\n|------|-----------|------|\n| 🎯 泵设备 | `widget_pump_001` | 泵运行状态显示 |\n| 🛢️ 储罐 | `widget_tank_001` | 液位可视化 |\n| 🌡️ 压力计 | `widget_pressure_gauge` | 压力显示 |\n| 🟢 启动按钮 | `widget_btn_start` | 绿色 START 按钮 |\n| 🔴 停止按钮 | `widget_btn_stop` | 红色 STOP 按钮 |\n| 📝 状态标签 | `label_pump_status` | 泵状态文字 |\n| 📝 压力标签 | `label_pressure` | 压力值显示 |\n| 📝 液位标签 | `label_level` | 液位值显示 |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 无法完成的部分\n\n由于**缺少点位管理工具**，以下功能暂时无法配置：\n\n1. **SCADA 点位** - 需要创建以下点位：\n   - `PUMP_STATUS_001` (数字量 - 泵运行状态)\n   - `PUMP_FAULT_001` (数字量 - 泵故障)\n   - `PUMP_START_CMD_001` (数字量 - 启动命令)\n   - `PUMP_STOP_CMD_001` (数字量 - 停止命令)\n   - `PRESSURE_001` (模拟量 - 压力)\n   - `LEVEL_001` (模拟量 - 液位)\n\n2. **启停控制脚本** - 需要点位才能绑定\n\n3. **报警配置** - 需要先有点位才能创建报警\n\n---\n\n**建议**：请确认是否有其他方式创建 SCADA 点位，或者您希望我切换到其他阶段继续配置其他功能？\n\nnext_state: CONFIG_ALARM", "reasoning": "I see the issue - the points don't exist in the system yet. I need to create the points first before I can bind scripts or alarms to them. However, looking at the available tools in the current BIND_POINTS stage, I don't see a \"manage_bindings\" tool or a \"create_point\" tool.\n\nLet me check what tools are available:\n- manage_alarms\n- manage_pages\n- manage_graphics\n- manage_scripts\n- manage_reports\n- manage_history\n- manage_schedules\n\nNone of these tools can create points. The BIND_POINTS stage should have a point management tool, but it's not available.\n\nSince I cannot create points with the current tools, I should inform the user about this limitation and suggest switching to a different stage or completing what I can.\n\nI've already created:\n1. Pump station control console page (page_pump_station_001)\n2. Various widgets (pump, tank, pressure gauge, start/stop buttons)\n3. Text labels for the UI\n\nWhat I cannot do due to missing points:\n1. Create scripts that bind to points\n2. Create alarms that monitor points\n\nI should explain this to the user and offer to proceed to the next stage (CONFIG_ALARM) to at least document what alarms would be needed, or switch to another stage where I can make progress."}, {"turn": 12, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 11246, "output_tokens": 939, "latency_ms": 30889.077600000746, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前系统状态，我已尽力完成了配置。让我总结一下：\n\n---\n\n## ✅ 已完成的配置\n\n### 1. 泵站控制台页面 (`page_pump_station_001`)\n- 创建了 1920×1080 分辨率的 HMI 页面\n- 包含泵设备、储罐、压力计、启停按钮等控件\n- 添加了状态显示标签\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 无法完成的配置（缺少点位）\n\n当前系统**没有 SCADA 点位**，而创建报警和脚本需要先有存在的点位。\n\n### 需要创建的点位（用于报警）：\n\n| 点位ID | 类型 | 用途 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| `PUMP_FAULT_001` | 数字量 | 泵故障报警 |\n| `PRESSURE_001` | 模拟量 | 压力高/低限报警 |\n| `LEVEL_001` | 模拟量 | 液位高/低限报警 |\n| `PUMP_STATUS_001` | 数字量 | 泵运行状态 |\n| `PUMP_START_CMD_001` | 数字量 | 启动命令 |\n| `PUMP_STOP_CMD_001` | 数字量 | 停止命令 |\n\n### 计划创建的报警：\n\n| 报警ID | 类型 | 绑定点位 | 条件 |\n|--------|------|----------|------|\n| `alarm_pump_fault` | 数字报警 | PUMP_FAULT_001 | 故障时触发（高优先级） |\n| `alarm_pressure_high` | 模拟报警 | PRESSURE_001 | >8 bar |\n| `alarm_pressure_low` | 模拟报警 | PRESSURE_001 | <1 bar |\n| `alarm_level_high` | 模拟报警 | LEVEL_001 | >90% |\n| `alarm_level_low` | 模拟报警 | LEVEL_001 | <10% |\n\n---\n\n## 📋 后续步骤建议\n\n1. **创建 SCADA 点位** - 需要点位管理工具（当前工具集不可用）\n2. **配置报警** - 使用 manage_alarms 创建上述报警\n3. **绑定控件与点位** - 将 HMI 控件与点位关联\n4. **创建控制脚本** - 实现启停逻辑\n\n---\n\n由于当前工具集缺少点位创建功能，报警配置暂时无法继续。如果您能提供点位创建的方式，我可以立即完成报警配置。\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The user is asking me to continue in the CONFIG_ALARM stage. Looking at the current situation:\n\n1. I've created a pump station control console page with widgets\n2. But there are no SCADA points created in the system\n3. Without points, I cannot create alarms or bind scripts to points\n\nIn the CONFIG_ALARM stage, I have access to:\n- manage_alarms: create_digital_alarm, create_analog_alarm, disable_alarm, delete_alarm, enable_alarm\n- manage_points: list_points (but this has been failing with schema errors)\n\nThe problem is that the points don't exist. The tools available don't include a way to CREATE points - only to list them or manage alarms.\n\nLooking at the available tools again:\n- manage_alarms: alarm management\n- manage_pages: page & widget management\n- manage_graphics: graphical primitives\n- manage_scripts: script management\n- manage_reports: report templates\n- manage_history: historian config\n- manage_schedules: scheduled jobs\n\nNone of these tools can CREATE SCADA points. The system seems to be missing a \"manage_points\" tool with \"create_point\" action.\n\nGiven the constraints:\n1. I cannot create points with the available tools\n2. I cannot create alarms without existing points\n3. I cannot create scripts without existing points\n\nThe best I can do is:\n1. Explain the situation to the user\n2. Document what WOULD be configured if points existed\n3. Suggest next steps\n\nSince this is a SCADA configuration assistant and I'm limited by the available tools, I should be transparent about what's possible and what's not.\n\nLet me check if I should just proceed to DONE since I've done what I can with the available tools."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 77513, "output_tokens": 7133, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 238820.34759999986}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "eccc2f6c-2dfb-409d-9d20-a3e5cd76b843", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:475acf1b138c3254241ea5bc9e3026b3872809cbc539ca060c86f7f668b25a23", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-029", "text": "复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T07:04:18.679Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T07:05:14.303Z", "total_turns": 4, "terminal_state": "DONE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T07:04:18.679Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T07:04:26.376Z"}, {"name": "DEPLOY", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T07:04:26.376Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T07:05:14.303Z"}, {"name": "DONE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T07:05:14.303Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T07:05:14.303Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "ws1", "name": "车间一"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.8619000000180677, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "DEPLOY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.4833000004728092, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 3, "state": "DEPLOY", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "show_deployment_status", "args": {"action": "show_deployment_status"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.7528000005549984, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": ["deployments.default"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:f4c1b6d5cc89f00171093fd26daf8088fe4803a78b0922514df6e54a6ca08699", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1631, "output_tokens": 174, "latency_ms": 7693.762099999731, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户的需求是：\n1. 复制\"车间一\"的页面到\"车间二\"\n2. 替换页面中所有'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'\n3. 做下装前校验\n\n当前阶段是VALIDATE，可用工具包括：\n- manage_pages: 当前只允许 list_pages\n- deployment: 允许 show_deployment_status 和 validate_project\n- manage_history: 允许 list_history\n- manage_points: 允许 list_points\n- manage_scripts: 允许 list_scripts\n\n首先，我需要了解当前有哪些页面，才能找到\"车间一\"的页面。让我先调用 manage_pages 的 list_pages 来查看页面列表。"}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1399, "output_tokens": 384, "latency_ms": 13003.697500000271, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "用户现在在 DEPLOY 阶段，可用工具只有 deployment。用户的需求是：\n1. 复制\"车间一\"的页面到\"车间二\"\n2. 替换页面中所有'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'\n3. 做下装前校验\n\n但 DEPLOY 阶段没有页面管理工具（manage_pages）。当前只能调用 deployment 工具，它的 actions 有：deploy_project, show_deployment_status, validate_project, rollback_deployment。\n\n用户要求\"做下装前校验\"，这对应 validate_project。但前面的\"复制页面\"和\"替换点位标签\"这两个操作，在 DEPLOY 阶段无法完成，因为 manage_pages 工具不可用。\n\n根据行为准则第5条：\"若当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，你可以在回复的纯文本中包含 'next_state: 阶段名' 来切换到【可切换的下一阶段】中的合适阶段\"。可切换的下一阶段是：DONE, VALIDATE。VALIDATE 阶段才有 manage_pages 工具（虽然只有 list_pages，但至少能查看页面）。不过，即使回到 VALIDATE 阶段，manage_pages 也只有 list_pages，没有复制、编辑页面的功能。实际上，用户需要的操作可能涉及页面编辑功能，这在当前工具集中都没有。\n\n但用户明确要求\"做下装前校验\"，这可以在 DEPLOY 阶段完成。或许我可以先执行 validate_project 校验，然后再考虑页面操作的问题。不过，如果页面复制和替换没有完成，校验可能也会失败。\n\n让我先调用 validate_project 看看当前项目状态。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1848, "output_tokens": 301, "latency_ms": 10881.982299999436, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "当前项目校验已通过（status: \"validated\"）。但用户的需求中还有两个操作未完成：复制页面和替换点位标签。这些操作在 DEPLOY 阶段无法执行，因为缺少相应的工具。根据行为准则，如果当前阶段的可用工具不满足需求，可以在回复的纯文本中包含 \"next_state: 阶段名\" 来切换阶段。可切换的下一阶段有 DONE 和 VALIDATE。VALIDATE 阶段有 manage_pages 工具（虽然只有 list_pages），但也没有复制、编辑页面的功能。实际上，用户需要的复制页面和替换点位标签操作，在现有工具集中都没有直接支持。也许这些操作需要在更早的阶段（如 CONFIG 或 EDIT）使用其他工具完成。但当前只有这些工具可用。\n\n我应该告知用户当前情况：项目校验已通过，但复制页面和替换点位标签的操作无法在 DEPLOY 阶段完成，需要更早阶段的工具。不过，既然用户要求做下装前校验，我已经执行了 validate_project，校验通过。或许我可以建议用户，如果页面复制和替换已在其他地方完成，那么现在可以下装。或者，如果这些操作还未完成，则需要先完成它们。\n\n让我先查看一下当前部署状态，了解更多信息。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2214, "output_tokens": 621, "latency_ms": 24027.40150000136, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "根据当前工具和阶段限制，我为您完成了以下工作：\n\n**已完成的操作：**\n1. ✅ **下装前校验**：已执行项目校验（validate_project），结果显示项目状态为\"validated\"（已校验通过），没有任何错误。\n2. ✅ **部署状态查看**：当前项目处于\"validated\"状态，可以进行部署。\n\n**需要说明的问题：**\n❌ **页面复制和点位替换**：在当前 DEPLOY 阶段，无法执行\"复制车间一的页面到车间二\"和\"替换WS1为WS2\"的操作，因为：\n   - 当前阶段只有 deployment 工具可用\n   - 页面编辑功能需要在更早的阶段（如 EDIT 或 CONFIG 阶段）使用 manage_pages 工具完成\n\n**当前状态：**\n- 项目已通过校验，可以安全下装\n- 如果页面复制和点位替换操作已在其他阶段完成，现在可以进行部署\n- 如果这些操作还未完成，需要先完成它们再进行部署\n\n**建议：**\n1. 如果您确认页面复制和点位替换已完成，我可以立即执行部署。\n2. 如果需要先完成页面操作，请告诉我，但需要切换到其他阶段使用相应工具。\n\n您希望如何继续？\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "根据工具返回的结果，当前项目状态已经是\"validated\"（校验通过），且没有任何错误。这意味着项目已经通过了校验，可以进行部署了。\n\n然而，用户的需求中提到要\"复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'\"，这个操作在当前DEPLOY阶段无法完成，因为DEPLOY阶段没有页面编辑工具（manage_pages只有list_pages功能，没有复制、编辑功能）。\n\n当前情况：\n1. 项目已通过校验（status: \"validated\"）\n2. 用户需要的页面复制和点位替换操作在DEPLOY阶段无法执行\n3. 用户要求做\"下装前校验\"，我已执行了validate_project并显示了状态\n\n我需要向用户说明情况：\n- 校验已通过，可以进行部署\n- 但页面复制和点位替换操作需要在更早的阶段（如编辑阶段）使用相应的工具完成\n- 如果这些操作已经完成，那么可以进行部署\n- 如果还未完成，需要回到编辑阶段完成这些操作\n\n根据行为准则，如果当前工具不能满足需求，可以在纯文本中包含\"next_state: 阶段名\"来切换阶段。但可切换的下一阶段只有DONE和VALIDATE。VALIDATE阶段虽然有manage_pages，但只有list_pages功能，没有编辑功能。实际上，页面编辑功能可能在更早的阶段（如EDIT或CONFIG），但这些阶段不在可切换列表中。\n\n我认为最好的做法是告知用户当前情况，并询问是否要执行部署，或者是否需要先完成页面操作。让我用纯文本回复用户。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7092, "output_tokens": 1480, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 55624.88049999956}, "judge": null}
{"trace_id": "a7f4de44-40a6-476c-b38b-03228fad3f0f", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:475acf1b138c3254241ea5bc9e3026b3872809cbc539ca060c86f7f668b25a23", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 1, "seed": 43}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-029", "text": "复制车间一的页面到车间二，替换其中所有的'WS1'点位标签为'WS2'，然后做下装前校验", "complexity": "complex", "domain": "multi"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T07:04:35.504Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T07:05:16.166Z", "total_turns": 3, "terminal_state": "VALIDATE", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "VALIDATE", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T07:04:35.504Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T07:05:16.166Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_pages", "action": "list_pages", "args": {"action": "list_pages"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "pages": [{"id": "ws1", "name": "车间一"}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4169999994919635, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 1, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["show_deployment_status", "validate_project"]}, {"name": "manage_history", "allowed_actions": ["list_history"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}, {"name": "manage_scripts", "allowed_actions": ["list_scripts"]}], "visible_count": 5, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 2, "points": [{"tag": "WS1_Status", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}, {"tag": "WS2_Status", "type": "digital", "unit": null, "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.1300000005576294, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [{"name": "deployment", "allowed_actions": ["deploy_project", "show_deployment_status", "validate_project", "rollback_deployment"]}], "visible_count": 1, "selected": "deployment", "action": "validate_project", "args": {"action": "validate_project", "deployment_id": "default", "target": "default"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"deployment_id": "default", "errors": [], "status": "validated"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"deployments.default": {"id": "default", "target": "default", "status": "validated", "validation_errors": [], "notes": ""}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.9054000001924578, "intended_entities": ["deployments.default"], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:a8b38ccbde7608389b905237a2c359bf6459a8a493f163a10a476a380590948e", "final_hash": "sha256:f4c1b6d5cc89f00171093fd26daf8088fe4803a78b0922514df6e54a6ca08699", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1631, "output_tokens": 342, "latency_ms": 12188.031100000444, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你处理这个需求。首先，我需要了解当前项目中的页面和点位信息，然后再进行后续操作。\n\n让我先查看现有的页面和点位配置：", "reasoning": "The user wants to:\n1. Copy \"车间一\" (Workshop 1) page to \"车间二\" (Workshop 2)\n2. Replace all 'WS1' point tags with 'WS2' in the copied page\n3. Run pre-deployment validation\n\nLet me first check what pages are available and what points exist, to understand the current state of the project. I'll start by listing pages and points.\n\nLooking at my available tools:\n- manage_pages: Only allows \"list_pages\" action - I cannot create or copy pages\n- deployment: Allows \"show_deployment_status\" and \"validate_project\" - I can validate\n- manage_points: Only allows \"list_points\" - I cannot modify points\n- manage_scripts: Only allows \"list_scripts\"\n- manage_history: Only allows \"list_history\"\n\nThe current stage is VALIDATE, and the only actions available are read-only operations. I cannot:\n- Copy/create pages (no such action in manage_pages)\n- Modify widget bindings (no such action)\n- Replace point tags\n\nLet me first gather information by listing pages and points, then explain to the user what I can and cannot do. I can run the validation check though.\n\nLet me start by listing pages to see what's available."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1649, "output_tokens": 514, "latency_ms": 18759.19090000025, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "当前项目状态已了解：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **现有页面** | 1个 - \"车间一\" (id: ws1) |\n| **现有点位** | WS1_Status、WS2_Status |\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 能力限制说明\n\n很抱歉，当前阶段（VALIDATE）我的可用工具**无法完成页面复制和点位替换**操作。具体来说：\n\n| 操作需求 | 当前能力 | 状态 |\n|----------|----------|------|\n| 复制页面（车间一 → 车间二） | 仅支持 `list_pages`，无法创建/复制页面 | ❌ 不支持 |\n| 替换点位标签（WS1 → WS2） | 仅支持 `list_points`，无法修改组件绑定 | ❌ 不支持 |\n| 下装前校验 | 支持 `validate_project` | ✅ 可执行 |\n\n---\n\n### 我现在能帮你做的\n\n我先执行**下装前校验**，检查当前项目的一致性：", "reasoning": "I can see:\n- Pages: Only 1 page exists - \"车间一\" (id: ws1)\n- Points: WS1_Status and WS2_Status exist\n\nThe user wants to:\n1. Copy 车间一 to 车间二\n2. Replace WS1 tags with WS2 in the copied page\n3. Run validation\n\nHowever, my available tools in the current VALIDATE stage are very limited:\n- manage_pages: Only \"list_pages\" - cannot create/copy pages\n- manage_points: Only \"list_points\" - cannot modify points\n- deployment: validate_project, show_deployment_status, deploy_project, rollback_deployment\n\nI don't have the capability to:\n- Create a new page\n- Copy a page\n- Modify widget bindings/replace point tags\n\nThese operations would need tools like \"create_page\", \"copy_page\", \"update_widget_binding\" etc., which are not available in the current stage.\n\nI should be transparent with the user about what I can and cannot do. I can at least run the validation on the current project state.\n\nLet me explain the situation and offer to run the validation as that's the only part I can accomplish."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2206, "output_tokens": 263, "latency_ms": 9699.119700000665, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **下装前校验通过！** 项目状态：`validated`，无错误。\n\n---\n\n### 📋 总结与建议\n\n| 步骤 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| ① 复制\"车间一\"页面为\"车间二\" | ❌ 需手动操作 |\n| ② 替换页面中 WS1→WS2 点位标签 | ❌ 需手动操作 |\n| ③ 下装前校验 | ✅ 已通过 |\n\n**你需要在 SCADA 编辑器中手动完成：**\n1. **复制页面**：进入页面管理，将\"车间一\"复制一份，命名为\"车间二\"\n2. **替换点位标签**：在\"车间二\"页面中，将所有绑定 `WS1_*` 的组件改为绑定 `WS2_*`\n3. **通知我再次校验**：页面配置完成后，告诉我\"校验\"，我会重新运行一致性检查，确保无误后再下装\n\n完成手动配置后请告诉我，我会立即执行校验并协助下装！", "reasoning": "Good, the validation passed. Now let me summarize for the user what was accomplished and what needs to be done manually."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "DeploymentCheck"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 5486, "output_tokens": 1119, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 40661.904599999616}, "judge": null}
