ency_ms": 12424.922700000025, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "好的，我来为您创建一个污水泵站总览画面。", "reasoning": "The user wants to create a new HMI page for a wastewater pump station overview screen. Let me parse their requirements:\n\n1. Name: 污水泵站总览画面 (Wastewater Pump Station Overview Screen)\n2. Background: Black (#000000)\n3. Resolution: 1920x1080\n4. Content: Title and two pumps placeholder\n\nI'll use the `create_page` action with:\n- id: something like \"pump_station_overview\" or \"main_overview\"\n- name: \"污水泵站总览\"\n- resolution: [1920, 1080]\n- background: \"#000000\" (black)\n\nNote: The tool only creates a page with basic properties (id, name, resolution, background). The actual widgets like title and pump placeholders would need to be added later, likely through binding points or other widget management tools that aren't currently available. I should create the page first and inform the user about what can be done next."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 1448, "output_tokens": 366, "latency_ms": 17221.674299998995, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **页面创建成功！**\n\n| 属性 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| 页面ID | `pump_station_overview` |\n| 页面名称 | 污水泵站总览 |\n| 分辨率 | 1920 × 1080 |\n| 背景色 | 黑色 (#000000) |\n\n---\n\n⚠️ **关于标题和泵占位：**\n\n当前工作流阶段（`configure_page`）仅支持**创建页面**和**绑定数据点**，暂不支持添加图形组件（如文字标题、泵图标等）。\n\n您可以：\n1. **先绑定数据点** — 如果两台泵已有对应的实时数据点（如运行状态、电流等），可以先将它们绑定到页面\n2. **切换到下一阶段** — 进入 `review` 或后续阶段，通常会提供完整的图形编辑器来放置标题和泵组件\n\n请问您希望如何继续？\n- 告诉我泵的数据点信息，我先完成绑定\n- 或者我们先继续进入下一阶段", "reasoning": "The page was created successfully. Now I need to inform the user about what was done and what the next steps would be. The user also mentioned they want to add a title and two pump placeholders. However, the current available tools don't include widget creation - only page creation and point binding are available.\n\nLet me check the available tools again:\n- create_page: Creates a new HMI page\n- bind_points: Binds real-time data points to page widgets\n\nI don't see a tool for adding widgets like text labels or pump graphics. I should inform the user that the page has been created but widget placement tools are not currently available in this phase."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PumpStationScreen"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 2412, "output_tokens": 678, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 29653.767300000254}, "judge": null}
