蓝色 (#2C3E50)。为了通用性，我选择浅灰色。另外，还需要指定页面尺寸。标准尺寸可以是1920x1080。\n\n我将创建一个页面，命名为\"主页\"或\"Main Page\"。页面ID可以是\"page_main\"。背景色设置为\"#F0F0F0\"。\n\n现在调用create_page工具。"}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2260, "output_tokens": 320, "latency_ms": 10568.928400000004, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "页面创建成功了，现在需要为这个页面创建一些图形元素来构成布局。当前可用的工具是manage_graphics，可以创建圆形、矩形、文本、线条等基本图形。用户说\"颜色好看点\"，我需要设计一个美观的布局。\n\n首先，我应该为页面创建一个标题区域。可以在页面顶部创建一个矩形作为标题栏，然后添加文本。还可以添加一些装饰性的元素。\n\n让我先创建一个标题栏矩形，使用深蓝色作为背景，看起来专业一些。然后添加标题文本。接着可以添加一些其他区域的矩形，比如一个信息面板。\n\n我需要为每个图形元素指定widget_id。我应该使用有意义的ID，比如\"title_bar\"、\"main_title\"等。\n\n开始创建标题栏：矩形，位置在(0,0)，大小1920x100，深蓝色背景。然后创建标题文本，放在矩形内。使用白色文字。\n\n让我一步步来。首先创建标题栏矩形。"}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2639, "output_tokens": 348, "latency_ms": 14849.791699998605, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "目前项目中没有任何页面，我需要先切换到 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段来创建页面。\n\n当前情况说明：\n- 项目中没有已存在的页面（pages 列表为空）\n- 在当前 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段，我只能在**已有页面**上绘制图形元素\n- 需要先创建一个页面，才能进行布局设计\n\n**next_state: MANAGE_PAGES**\n\n切换到 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段后，我可以为您：\n1. 创建一个新的 HMI 页面\n2. 设置页面尺寸和背景色\n3. 然后再返回 GENERATE_LAYOUT 阶段进行布局美化", "reasoning": "The page wasn't found. It seems the create_page action didn't actually persist the page. Let me check the available tools again - in the current phase (GENERATE_LAYOUT), I only have:\n\n1. manage_graphics with actions: create_circle, create_rect, create_text, create_line\n2. manage_pages with actions: list_pages\n\nThe create_page action is NOT available in the current phase. I can only use list_pages to view existing pages. Since there are no pages available, I cannot create graphics on them.\n\nI need to inform the user that there are no existing pages available, and I need to switch to a different phase (MANAGE_PAGES) where I can create a page first.\n\nWait, let me re-read the instructions. The current phase is GENERATE_LAYOUT, and the available actions for manage_pages is only \"list_pages\". The create_page action is not available in this phase.\n\nI should inform the user that there are no pages available and suggest switching to MANAGE_PAGES phase to create a page first."}, {"turn": 5, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3022, "output_tokens": 187, "latency_ms": 7517.943599999853, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "现在我在MANAGE_PAGES阶段，可用工具是manage_pages，支持的操作有list_pages、create_page、create_widget。我需要创建一个新页面。之前尝试创建页面但返回了空的pages列表，可能是因为create_page操作没有正确执行。让我再试一次创建页面。这次我会确保参数正确。页面ID可以是\"page_main\"，名称可以是\"主页\"，尺寸[1920,1080]，背景色\"#F0F0F0\"。调用create_page。"}, {"turn": 6, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3269, "output_tokens": 96, "latency_ms": 3539.4348000008904, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The schema requires \"id\" instead of \"page_id\". Let me try again with the correct field name."}, {"turn": 7, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3425, "output_tokens": 331, "latency_ms": 10162.03730000052, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "抱歉，我遇到了一个问题。在当前 **MANAGE_PAGES** 阶段，可用的操作只有 **list_pages**（列出页面），不支持创建新页面。\n\n让我再次确认一下当前的页面状态：", "reasoning": "Let me check the tool definition again. The manage_pages tool only allows \"list_pages\" action in the current phase. The schema I'm seeing shows:\n\n\"oneOf\": [{\"type\": \"object\", \"title\": \"list_pages\", \"description\": \"Return the list of pages with their IDs and names.\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"const\": \"list_pages\"}}, \"required\": [\"action\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}]\n\nSo only list_pages is available. The create_page action is not available in this phase. I was wrong about what actions are available. Let me re-read the available tools:\n\n【当前可用工具】(仅以下工具可被调用)\n- manage_graphics: Graphical primitives, layouts, grouping, styling.; 当前允许 actions: create_circle, create_rect, create_text, create_line\n- manage_pages: HMI page & widget management, including point↔widget binding.; 当前允许 actions: list_pages\n\nSo manage_pages only allows list_pages action. I cannot create a page. This is a problem.\n\nI should inform the user that I cannot create pages in the current phase, and there are no existing pages to work with. I might need to suggest switching to a different phase or ask for more information."}, {"turn": 8, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3816, "output_tokens": 64, "latency_ms": 3158.681200000501, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "It seems like the tool is interpreting my calls incorrectly. Let me be very precise with the JSON schema. The list_pages action should only require the \"action\" field set to \"list_pages\"."}, {"turn": 9, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 3940, "output_tokens": 97, "latency_ms": 6482.720699999845, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": null, "reasoning": "The tool keeps returning SCHEMA_ERROR about \"create_page.id: Field required\". This seems like a bug in the system - it's trying to interpret my list_pages call as a create_page call.\n\nLet me try providing the \"id\" field along with the list_pages action to see if that helps resolve the issue."}, {"turn": 10, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4097, "output_tokens": 283, "latency_ms": 12153.728700001011, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我注意到系统存在一些问题。让我尝试一个不同的方式：", "reasoning": "It seems like there's an issue with the manage_pages tool. Let me try a different approach - maybe I need to provide all parameters correctly. The tool keeps saying \"create_page.id: Field required\" even when I'm trying to use list_pages.\n\nLet me check - the current available tool is:\n- manage_pages: HMI page & widget management, including point↔widget binding.; 当前允许 actions: list_pages\n\nSo only list_pages is available in MANAGE_PAGES phase. But the error keeps mentioning create_page.id, which suggests the system might be having issues.\n\nLet me try to switch to GENERATE_LAYOUT and see if I can work with graphics there. But wait - the page wasn't found before because there were no pages.\n\nActually, looking at the user's request again - they want to \"改一下那个画面\" (modify that screen/page) and make the colors look better. But there are no pages in the system.\n\nGiven the constraints:\n1. MANAGE_PAGES only allows list_pages\n2. GENERATE_LAYOUT allows graphics primitives but requires existing pages\n\nI should inform the user about this limitation. Let me try one more time with manage_pages to list pages, then explain the situation."}, {"turn": 11, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4440, "output_tokens": 250, "latency_ms": 31493.16429999999, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "您好，我发现当前系统存在一个问题：\n\n**问题描述：**\n- 当前项目中没有任何页面\n- 在 MANAGE_PAGES 阶段，系统虽然支持创建页面，但调用时持续报错 `\"create_page.id: Field required\"`\n- 即使是查询操作（list_pages）也返回同样的错误\n\n**现状：**\n- 无法创建新页面\n- 无法列出已有页面（因为确实没有页面）\n\n**建议：**\n1. 请确认您的 SCADA 项目是否已经正确初始化？\n2. 是否有其他方式可以先创建一个基础页面（例如通过项目配置文件或其他管理工具）？\n3. 或者您是否有已存在的页面 ID 可以提供给我？\n\n如果您能告诉我页面的 ID 或名称，我可以尝试切换到 **GENERATE_LAYOUT** 阶段，在该页面上进行图形布局和美化工作。\n\n请问您希望如何继续？", "reasoning": "The system seems to have an issue - the list_pages action keeps returning a schema error about \"create_page.id\" being required, which doesn't make sense for a list operation. This appears to be a system bug.\n\nLet me inform the user about this issue and suggest what we can do."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "GraphicsLayout"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 34112, "output_tokens": 2394, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 119390.97839999886}, "judge": null}
