xt": "我来帮您查找 TEMP_ZONE_1 的相关信息。首先，让我查看当前项目中已有的点位配置。", "reasoning": "The user wants to modify an existing high-temperature alarm for TEMP_ZONE_1, changing its priority from medium to high. This is an alarm configuration task.\n\nLet me first understand the current situation:\n- Current workflow: AlarmConfig\n- Current step: discover_points\n- Available tools: manage_pages (list_pages), manage_points (list_points)\n\nThe user wants to modify alarm settings, which would typically require alarm management tools. However, looking at my current available tools, I only have:\n- manage_pages: with list_pages action\n- manage_points: with list_points action\n\nNeither of these tools has the capability to modify alarm configurations. I don't have a tool to configure or modify alarms directly in the current state.\n\nLet me first check what points are available to understand the TEMP_ZONE_1 point, and then I should inform the user that I need to switch to the CONFIG_ALARM phase to actually modify alarm settings.\n\nLet me first query the points to discover TEMP_ZONE_1 and understand its current configuration."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2144, "output_tokens": 264, "latency_ms": 10971.866599998975, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "我已进入 CONFIG_ALARM 阶段。要修改 TEMP_ZONE_1 现有高温报警的优先级，我需要知道该报警的 ID。\n\n请问您能提供该高温报警的 ID 吗？例如它可能类似 `alarm_temp_zone_1_high` 或其他命名格式？\n\n如果您不确定报警 ID，我可以帮您查找当前系统中已配置的所有报警。请告诉我您希望如何操作。", "reasoning": "用户想要修改 TEMP_ZONE_1 现有的高温报警，将优先级从 medium 提升到 high。\n\n首先我需要了解当前系统中的报警配置。让我查看一下有哪些报警与 TEMP_ZONE_1 相关。\n\n我应该先询问用户该报警的ID是什么，或者尝试查找相关的报警。由于用户提到了\"现有高温报警\"，这意味着已经存在一个报警配置。\n\n让我先列出当前所有点位，然后根据用户提供的信息来操作。\n\n实际上，用户已经指定了 TEMP_ZONE_1 这个点位，并且提到了\"现有高温报警\"。但是我需要知道具体的报警ID才能修改它的优先级。\n\n我应该：\n1. 先询问用户报警的ID是什么\n2. 或者尝试根据命名规则来猜测报警ID\n\n让我先询问用户具体的报警ID，这样更准确。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3106, "ou