{"trace_id": "749f7260-398a-4b0e-b81f-a000b571f0d2", "experiment": {"config_name": "D_hier_rag_workflow", "config_hash": "sha256:475acf1b138c3254241ea5bc9e3026b3872809cbc539ca060c86f7f668b25a23", "code_commit": "6c299a18e517871b834f2a6226522e7c6e6c6e40", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "dataset_version": "dev", "rep_index": 0, "seed": 42}, "query": {"golden_id": "golden-044", "text": "给不存在的NO_SUCH_TEMP配置高温报警，阈值90", "complexity": "medium", "domain": "alarm"}, "execution": {"started_at": "2026-06-16T07:21:11.044Z", "completed_at": "2026-06-16T07:21:25.858Z", "total_turns": 2, "terminal_state": "CONFIG_ALARM", "early_terminated": false, "termination_reason": null}, "states": [{"name": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T07:21:11.044Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T07:21:17.942Z"}, {"name": "CONFIG_ALARM", "entered_at": "2026-06-16T07:21:17.942Z", "exited_at": "2026-06-16T07:21:25.858Z"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "state": "ANALYZE_INTENT", "visible_tools": [{"name": "manage_pages", "allowed_actions": ["list_pages"]}, {"name": "manage_points", "allowed_actions": ["list_points"]}], "visible_count": 2, "selected": "manage_points", "action": "list_points", "args": {"action": "list_points"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"count": 1, "points": [{"tag": "TEMP_REAL", "type": "analog", "unit": "°C", "min": null, "max": null, "description": null}]}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 1.4062999998714076, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:0d22b095fd587ab7ba4c2964c0315c76dc3f059014e4206987f8ada572f67584", "final_hash": "sha256:0d22b095fd587ab7ba4c2964c0315c76dc3f059014e4206987f8ada572f67584", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 962, "output_tokens": 161, "latency_ms": 6892.684599999484, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我需要先确认点位 `NO_SUCH_TEMP` 是否存在于系统中。让我先查询一下当前所有的点位。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure a high-temperature alarm for a point called \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" with a threshold of 90. \n\nLet me first check if this point exists in the system. I should call the manage_points tool to list points and verify whether \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" exists.\n\nThe user explicitly said \"不存在的\" (non-existent), so they already know the point doesn't exist. But as a responsible assistant, I should verify this by listing the points first before proceeding.\n\nLet me check the available points first."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2049, "output_tokens": 296, "latency_ms": 7911.408599999049, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "## ⚠️ 无法执行此操作\n\n经过查询，系统中 **不存在** 名为 `NO_SUCH_TEMP` 的点位。当前系统中仅存在以下点位：\n\n| 点位名 | 类型 | 单位 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| TEMP_REAL | analog | °C |\n\n**报警必须绑定到已存在的 SCADA 点位上**，为一个不存在的点位配置报警是无效的配置，会导致：\n- 报警无法正常触发\n- 系统运行时可能产生错误\n\n---\n\n### 您可以：\n\n1. **先创建点位 `NO_SUCH_TEMP`**，然后再配置报警。（需要切换到点位管理阶段）\n2. **为已有的 `TEMP_REAL` 配置高温报警**，阈值 90°C。\n\n请告诉我您希望如何操作？", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure a high-temperature alarm for a point called \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" with a threshold of 90. However, based on the previous query, this point does not exist in the system - the only point available is \"TEMP_REAL\".\n\nI should not create an alarm for a non-existent point. This would be an invalid configuration. I need to inform the user that the point \"NO_SUCH_TEMP\" does not exist and therefore cannot have an alarm configured on it.\n\nLet me explain this to the user and suggest alternatives."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 3011, "output_tokens": 457, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14813.255600000048}, "judge": null}
