_A.bindings.frequency": "PUMP_A_HZ"}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 1.0402000007161405, "intended_entities": ["pages.pump_panel.widgets.pump_A.bindings.frequency"], "referenced_entities": ["pages.pump_panel", "pages.pump_panel.widgets.pump_A", "points.PUMP_A_HZ"]}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:5a2353e6593461f42f0035dfd8b0fda32b2d6071b4a7a418f6195248f485c2bc", "final_hash": "sha256:ae4872f0745ce3e42d323f993ef7c6d790b108a5c2679fea5e6ad04d9683c83b", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 972, "output_tokens": 170, "latency_ms": 9760.937800001557, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查看现有的页面和点位信息，确认\"pump_panel\"页面以及相关点位是否存在。", "reasoning": "The user wants to add a pump graphic (图元) on the \"pump_panel\" page, with:\n- Running status bound to point PUMP_A_RUN\n- Frequency bound to point PUMP_A_HZ\n\nFirst, I need to understand the current state. I should:\n1. Check if the \"pump_panel\" page exists\n2. Check if the points PUMP_A_RUN and PUMP_A_HZ exist\n\nLet me call both tools to get this information."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4455, "output_tokens": 265, "latency_ms": 8173.757500000647, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "✅ **pump_panel** 页面存在，点位 **PUMP_A_RUN**（数字量）和 **PUMP_A_HZ**（模拟量）也已配置就绪。现在开始添加泵图元并绑定点位。\n\n**第一步：在 pump_panel 页面创建泵图元**", "reasoning": "The page \"pump_panel\" exists and the points PUMP_A_RUN (digital) and PUMP_A_HZ (analog) also exist. Now I need to:\n\n1. Create a pump widget on the pump_panel page\n2. Bind PUMP_A_RUN to the running status property\n3. Bind PUMP_A_HZ to the frequency property\n\nLet me first create the pump widget. I'll use a reasonable position and size, then bind the two points.\n\nI need to do this step by step - first create the widget, then bind the points."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4772, "output_tokens": 233, "latency_ms": 9852.009900001576, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "泵图元创建成功！**第二步：绑定点位** — 将 PUMP_A_RUN 绑定到运行状态，PUMP_A_HZ 绑定到频率：", "reasoning": "The pump widget has been created successfully. Now I need to bind the two points:\n1. PUMP_A_RUN → pump_A.run_status (or similar property for running status)\n2. PUMP_A_HZ → pump_A.frequency (or similar property for frequency)\n\nLet me bind both properties now."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5085, "output_tokens": 191, "latency_ms": 6548.756699998194, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **全部配置完成！** 汇总如下：\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | `pump_panel`（泵面板） |\n| **图元 ID** | `pump_A`（泵） |\n| **位置/尺寸** | (200, 200) / 120×120 |\n| **绑定 ①** | `run_status` ← `PUMP_A_RUN`（数字量，运行状态） |\n| **绑定 ②** | `frequency` ← `PUMP_A_HZ`（模拟量，频率 Hz） |\n\n运行时，泵图元将根据 **PUMP_A_RUN** 的值动态显示启/停状态，并实时读取 **PUMP_A_HZ** 显示当前运行频率。", "reasoning": "All bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 15284, "output_tokens": 859, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 34374.72709999929}, "judge": null}
