 | MPa |\n\n罐体已放置在页面坐标 (200, 100)，尺寸为 200×300 像素。", "reasoning": "看起来绑定创建成功了。让我总结一下完成的工作。"}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 16559, "output_tokens": 902, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 30431.707700001425}, "judge": null}
