v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5270, "output_tokens": 286, "latency_ms": 9268.619200000103, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "罐体控件创建成功！现在绑定三个点位到罐体的对应属性：", "reasoning": "The tank widget was created successfully. Now I need to bind the three points to the tank widget properties:\n- LT_01 → level/value property\n- TT_01 → temperature property\n- PT_01 → pressure property\n\nLet me make all three binding calls in parallel since they are independent."}, {"turn": 4, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 5670, "output_tokens": 304, "latency_ms": 10327.279799999815, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "✅ **配置完成！** 已在 **chem_panel（化工面板）** 页面成功创建罐体并完成点位绑定。\n\n### 配置摘要\n\n| 项目 | 详情 |\n|------|------|\n| **页面** | chem_panel（化工面板） |\n| **控件** | tank_01（罐体） |\n| **位置** | (100, 80)，尺寸 200×300 |\n\n### 点位绑定关系\n\n| 属性 | 绑定点位 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| `level` | LT_01 | 液位 (m) |\n| `temperature` | TT_01 | 温度 (°C) |\n| `pressure` | PT_01 | 压力 (MPa) |\n\n罐体现在可以实时显示液位、温度和压力数据。如需进一步配置（如添加报警、趋势曲线或文字标签等），请告诉我！\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "All three bindings were successful. Let me summarize what was done:\n1. Created tank widget \"tank_01\" on the chem_panel page\n2. Bound LT_01 (liquid level) to the tank's level property\n3. Bound TT_01 (temperature) to the tank's temperature property\n4. Bound PT_01 (pressure) to the tank's pressure property\n\nThe task is complete."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "PointBinding"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 16802, "output_tokens": 1143, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 39164.09809999823}, "judge": null}
