reate_analog_alarm", "id": "alarm_PT101_high", "tag": "PT101", "high_limit": "2.0", "priority": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_PT101_high"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_PT101_high": {"id": "alarm_PT101_high", "tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 2.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "medium", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.9550999966450036, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_PT101_high"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT101"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.005400012014433742, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:c3f274ad003b69e51d552d5ae412638ea5f2bf35d91b3b31da4d1b69eebd6538", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 183, "latency_ms": 5152.195400005439, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来帮你配置报警。首先需要确认点位 PT101 是否存在，让我查询一下项目中的点位信息。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure a high-limit alarm for point PT101 with threshold 2.0 and medium priority.\n\nI'm currently in the ANALYZE_INTENT stage with AlarmConfig workflow, step=discover_points.\n\nFirst, I should check if the point PT101 exists. Let me list the points to verify PT101 is available.\n\nThe available tools are:\n1. manage_pages - for HMI page & widget management (only list_pages action available)\n2. manage_points - for SCADA points (only list_points action available)\n\nLet me first call manage_points to list points and verify PT101 exists."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2076, "output_tokens": 234, "latency_ms": 9409.074499999406, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "点位 **PT101** 已确认存在，是一个模拟量（analog）点位。现在为它创建高限报警。", "reasoning": "点位 PT101 存在，是一个模拟量点位(analog type)。现在我需要为它创建一个模拟量高限报警，阈值设为 2.0，中等优先级。\n\n调用 manage_alarms 工具，使用 create_analog_alarm 动作，参数：\n- id: 需要生成一个唯一的报警 ID，如 \"alarm_PT101_high\"\n- tag: \"PT101\"\n- high_limit: 2.0\n- low_limit: 不需要设低限，设为 null\n- priority: \"medium\""}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4320, "output_tokens": 185, "latency_ms": 5180.2530999993905, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "报警配置已完成！以下是配置摘要：\n\n| 配置项 | 值 |\n|--------|-----|\n| **报警 ID** | alarm_PT101_high |\n| **监控点位** | PT101 |\n| **报警类型** | 模拟量高限报警 |\n| **高限阈值** | 2.0 |\n| **优先级** | 中等 (medium) |\n\n当 PT101 的值超过 **2.0** 时，系统将触发该报警。\n\n请问你还需要进行其他操作吗？例如：\n- 为该报警添加通知规则（邮件、短信等）\n- 添加低限报警\n- 配置死区（deadband）防止报警抖动\n- 或者完成当前任务\n\nnext_state: DONE", "reasoning": "The alarm has been successfully created. Let me summarize what was done for the user."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7363, "output_tokens": 602, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 19755.712300015148}, "judge": null}
