": "medium"}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"alarm_id": "alarm_pt101_high"}, "world_diff": {"added_or_modified": {"alarms.alarm_pt101_high": {"id": "alarm_pt101_high", "tag": "PT101", "type": "analog", "high_limit": 2.0, "low_limit": null, "deadband": 0.0, "priority": "medium", "enabled": true}}, "removed": []}, "latency_ms": 0.8272000122815371, "intended_entities": ["alarms.alarm_pt101_high"], "referenced_entities": ["points.PT101"]}, {"turn": 2, "state": "VALIDATE", "visible_tools": [], "visible_count": 0, "selected": "workflow:handlers.validate_project", "action": null, "args": {}, "schema_valid": true, "result_ok": true, "error_code": "OK", "error_msg": null, "result_data": {"ok": true, "checked_at": "validate_project"}, "world_diff": null, "latency_ms": 0.0041000021155923605, "intended_entities": [], "referenced_entities": []}], "resource_reads": [], "world_snapshots": {"initial_hash": "sha256:e2c29cbc7447c81385d26f1579bf0aed934b95ee41882b9350d4f7775d3027a7", "final_hash": "sha256:319b464b61f3f0217ffb661b1a3779b04671b53dcdfea9a2e7b7281c52fa2ec2", "final_state_match": null, "match_mode": null, "diff_against_expected": {}}, "llm_calls": [{"turn": 1, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 967, "output_tokens": 122, "latency_ms": 3607.6993999886326, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "我来先查询一下系统中是否存在点位 PT101，然后再进行报警配置。", "reasoning": "The user wants to configure a high limit alarm for point PT101 with threshold 2.0 and medium priority. \n\nBefore I can configure an alarm, I need to:\n1. First discover what points exist in the system to verify PT101 exists\n2. Then configure the alarm\n\nLet me first check if PT101 exists by listing the points."}, {"turn": 2, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 2015, "output_tokens": 171, "latency_ms": 3823.5389000037685, "stop_reason": "tool_use", "text": "确认点位 PT101 存在且为模拟量点位，现在为其创建高限报警。", "reasoning": "Good, PT101 exists and it's an analog point, which is suitable for creating an analog alarm. Now I can proceed to create the high limit alarm for PT101 with:\n- Tag: PT101\n- High limit: 2.0\n- Priority: medium\n\nI'll use the create_analog_alarm action."}, {"turn": 3, "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "input_tokens": 4196, "output_tokens": 259, "latency_ms": 6567.222599987872, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "text": "报警配置已完成！以下是配置摘要：\n\n| 配置项 | 值 |\n|--------|-----|\n| 报警ID | alarm_pt101_high |\n| 监控点位 | PT101（模拟量） |\n| 报警类型 | 高限报警 |\n| 高限阈值 | 2.0 |\n| 优先级 | 中等（medium） |\n\n当 PT101 的值超过 **2.0** 时，系统将触发报警。\n\n请问您还需要进行其他报警配置吗？例如：\n- 为 PT101 添加低限报警\n- 为其他点位配置报警\n- 配置报警通知规则\n\n如果报警配置已全部完成，我可以切换到下一阶段继续其他工作。", "reasoning": "The alarm has been successfully created. Let me summarize the results for the user. The task is complete - they asked to configure a high limit alarm for PT101 with threshold 2.0 and medium priority, and that has been done.\n\nSince this is just one alarm configuration request and it's completed, I should inform the user and ask if they need anything else. If they don't have more alarm configurations, we can move to the next phase."}], "rag": {"enabled": true, "top_n": 30, "top_k": 15, "alpha": 0.6, "use_reranker": true}, "workflow": {"enabled": true, "selected_workflow": "AlarmConfig"}, "totals": {"input_tokens": 7178, "output_tokens": 552, "cost_usd": 0.0, "e2e_latency_ms": 14011.571599985473}, "judge": null}
